    <description><![CDATA[<b>Vodopad Polikarya chairlift 1375 m - top of the lift serving the upper bike-park trails</b><br/><br/>
    Top station of the K1 gondola, where the descents start. See the main Krasnaya Polyana Bike Park pin for trails, prices and access.]]></description>
