  <Placemark>
    <name>Menton hinterland: Crête des Assalins</name>
    <description><![CDATA[1.5 km technically graded natural MTB trace, from Cime de Baudon 1265 m west along the Crete des Assalins ridge. Geometry simplified from OpenStreetMap (ODbL) - indicative only, follow local signs and check access. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/157711429">way 157711429</a>, <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/396552049">way 396552049</a>, <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/488115601">way 488115601</a>, <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/1007294130">way 1007294130</a>.</i>]]></description>
