    <name>Les Pléiades: top of the MVR rack railway</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Les Pléiades station (top of the MVR rack railway)</b><br/><br/>
    Top station of the MVR rack railway, where the descents start. See the main Les Pléiades pin for trails, prices and access.]]></description>
