  <Placemark>
    <name>Leysin: Ai Ai Ai</name>
    <description><![CDATA[0.3 km, +3/-88 m. A short, technical downhill line focused on precision rather than speed, with natural rock slabs, small jumps and an optional final drop beneath the lift. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.alpesvaudoises.ch/fr/V227697/leysin/ai-ai-ai">Alpes Vaudoises - Ai Ai Ai</a>. Official GPX geometry supplied by Alpes Vaudoises, simplified to 8 m.</i>]]></description>
