  <Placemark>
    <name>Leysin: Nerine - Les 3 Tours liaison</name>
    <description><![CDATA[0.2 km, -23 m. A short, quiet forest link from Nerine 3.1 to Les 3 Tours 2.2, providing a practical and pleasant transition between the two main runs. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.alpesvaudoises.ch/fr/V227700/leysin/liaison-nerine-3-tours">Alpes Vaudoises - Nerine - Les 3 Tours liaison</a>. Official GPX geometry supplied by Alpes Vaudoises, simplified to 8 m.</i>]]></description>
