  <Placemark>
    <name>Rochers-de-Naye (above Montreux) [70 CHF return]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Montreux 400 m - valley station of the Rochers-de-Naye cog railway</b><br/><br/>Where the MOB rack railway to Rochers-de-Naye starts. See the Caux and La Perche waypoints for the descents themselves.]]></description>
