    </ExtendedData>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Naye: La Perche halt</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Request stop on the rack railway and the start of the classic La Perche descent variant. Handy bail-out if the weather turns on the summit.]]></description>
