      <mwm:icon>Transport</mwm:icon>
      <mwm:visibility>1</mwm:visibility>
    </ExtendedData>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Crans-Montana: Plaine Morte - Sion epic</name>
    <description><![CDATA[~26 km high-alpine ridge descent from the Plaine Morte glacier (2880 m) to Sion, dropping ~2400 m past Col du Rawyl, Schnidejoch and Sex Rouge. Long, remote terrain: check conditions before riding. <i>Source: recorded.</i>]]></description>
