  <Placemark>
    <name>Crans-Montana: Chetseron Downhill</name>
    <description><![CDATA[2.9 km, +13/-616 m. A steep, demanding black trail for experienced riders, winding through roots, rocks and forest, with the Valais Alps and the Rhone Valley as a spectacular backdrop. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.crans-montana.ch/en/mod_oa#ipd=807764294">Crans-Montana - Chetseron Downhill</a>. Official Outdooractive geometry supplied by Crans-Montana, simplified to 8 m.</i>]]></description>
