  <Placemark>
    <name>Crans-Montana: Family Forest Loop</name>
    <description><![CDATA[3.7 km, +124/-124 m. An obstacle course on a loop through the Moubra forest, ideal for trying mountain biking for the first time. A great outing for families and beginners. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.crans-montana.ch/en/mod_oa#ipd=807764041">Crans-Montana - Family Forest Loop</a>. Official Outdooractive geometry supplied by Crans-Montana, simplified to 8 m.</i>]]></description>
