  <Placemark>
    <name>Crans-Montana: Hauts de Crans Bike</name>
    <description><![CDATA[7.2 km, +291/-291 m. Loop trail starting in Montana, offering an accessible MTB ride through forest paths, lakes and open alpine views. Highlights include lake Chermignon, Arnouva and Vermala, before a gentle return to the centre. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.crans-montana.ch/en/mod_oa#ipd=807764082">Crans-Montana - Hauts de Crans Bike</a>. Official Outdooractive geometry supplied by Crans-Montana, simplified to 8 m.</i>]]></description>
