    <name>Crans-Montana: Courtavey Bike</name>
    <description><![CDATA[12.2 km, +493/-494 m. Between asphalt roads, gravel paths and forest trails, this easy loop reveals the diversity of Crans-Montana, with forests, clearings, mountain pastures and views of the Valais Alps. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.crans-montana.ch/en/mod_oa#ipd=807764086">Crans-Montana - Courtavey Bike</a>. Official Outdooractive geometry supplied by Crans-Montana, simplified to 8 m.</i>]]></description>
