  <Placemark>
    <name>Crans-Montana: Alpages Bike</name>
    <description><![CDATA[21.3 km, +918/-917 m. This mountain bike route explores the region's high alpine pastures. It is a sporty way to discover the local wildlife and plant life, with superb views across the surrounding peaks. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.crans-montana.ch/en/mod_oa#ipd=807764113">Crans-Montana - Alpages Bike</a>. Official Outdooractive geometry supplied by Crans-Montana, simplified to 8 m.</i>]]></description>
