  <Placemark>
    <name>Crans-Montana: Crans-Montana Marathon Bike</name>
    <description><![CDATA[47.0 km, +2013/-2013 m. Challenging loop through alpine pastures, forests and vineyards, with stunning views of the Alps and the Rhone valley. A full-on ride for experienced mountain bikers. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.crans-montana.ch/en/mod_oa#ipd=807764127">Crans-Montana - Crans-Montana Marathon Bike</a>. Official Outdooractive geometry supplied by Crans-Montana, simplified to 8 m.</i>]]></description>
