  <Placemark>
    <name>Crans-Montana: Plateau Bike</name>
    <description><![CDATA[19.7 km, +816/-816 m. This moderately challenging mountain bike loop provides a great overview of the Crans-Montana High Plateau, through a landscape of forests and sweeping views across the Rhone Valley. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.crans-montana.ch/en/mod_oa#ipd=807764254">Crans-Montana - Plateau Bike</a>. Official Outdooractive geometry supplied by Crans-Montana, simplified to 8 m.</i>]]></description>
