  <Placemark>
    <name>Crans-Montana: Plaine Morte Bike</name>
    <description><![CDATA[37.6 km, +1027/-3369 m. This demanding alpine route, from the Plaine Morte to the forests of the Pfyn-Finges Nature Park is punctuated by glaciers, high-altitude lakes, waterfalls, and alpine meadows. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.crans-montana.ch/en/mod_oa#ipd=807854622">Crans-Montana - Plaine Morte Bike</a>. Official Outdooractive geometry supplied by Crans-Montana, simplified to 8 m.</i>]]></description>
