  <Placemark>
    <name>Diablerets: Isenau Bike (590)</name>
    <description><![CDATA[15.4 km blue enduro trail near Diablerets. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/relation/27184">OpenStreetMap relation 27184</a>.</i>]]></description>
