    <name>Les Haberes: La Daranverte</name>
    <description><![CDATA[2.2 km green downhill trail for beginners, descending through forest and alpine meadows from the top of the Darandet chairlift. <i>Source: <a href="https://leshaberes.com/dh-daranverte">Les Haberes official trail page</a>. Officially embedded OpenRunner GPX geometry, simplified to 8 m.</i>]]></description>
