    <name>Champery: Crosets DH (red)</name>
    <description><![CDATA[1.4 km official bike-park trail. A shaped, flowing mix of technical riding and speed beside the Crosets chairlift, returning directly to the lift base. <i>Source and GPX: <a href="https://www.regiondentsdumidi.ch/en/6866740-dh-track-n03-red-crosets-63523/">Region Dents du Midi</a>.</i>]]></description>
