  <Placemark>
    <name>Champery: Loquet DH (red)</name>
    <description><![CDATA[0.6 km official bike-park trail. A short, fast and playful trail below the Mossettes chairlift, using the natural small canyons before returning to Les Crosets. <i>Source and GPX: <a href="https://www.regiondentsdumidi.ch/en/6866821-dh-track-n05-red-loquet-63533/">Region Dents du Midi</a>.</i>]]></description>
