  <Placemark>
    <name>Verbier: Enduro 07 - Fontanet - La Chaux</name>
    <description><![CDATA[4.6 km, +106/-320 m advanced enduro route. Technically and physically demanding alpine route from Fontanet to the Cabane Mont Fort, including a long, rocky traverse. The descent broadens below the hut before a standout singletrack follows the alpine stream back to La Chaux. Control speed near the busy hut section. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.verbier.ch/decouvrir/explore-activites/activites-sportives/balades-et-randonnees-pedestres/tous-les-itineraires-de-randonnee-et-les-balades/enduro-07-avance-fontanet-la-chaux-verbier-fr-2794120/">Verbier - Enduro 07</a>. Official GPX geometry, simplified to 8 m.</i>]]></description>
