  <Placemark>
    <name>Verbier: Enduro 15 - Moay - Cabane Brunet</name>
    <description><![CDATA[24.2 km, +857/-1,672 m advanced enduro route. Long, rolling tour from the top of the Bruson gondola at Moay to Cabane Brunet. After a traverse to Momin, a gravel climb gains about 500 m to the hut; the long, relatively easy descent toward Champsec and Le Chable repeatedly crosses the road. Watch for hikers and control speed. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.verbier.ch/decouvrir/explore-activites/activites-sportives/balades-et-randonnees-pedestres/tous-les-itineraires-de-randonnee-et-les-balades/enduro-15-avance-moay-cabane-brunet-verbier-fr-3110231/">Verbier - Enduro 15</a>. Official GPX geometry, simplified to 8 m.</i>]]></description>
