  <Placemark>
    <name>Verbier: Tsenelle</name>
    <description><![CDATA[1.8 km green downhill trail. Very easy flow trail from the top of La Chaux-Express to La Chaux. Its gentle, playful descent includes rest and learning areas, wooden sculptures, two bridges, and wide views over the Combins, Mont Fort and Mont Blanc. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.verbier.ch/decouvrir/explore-activites/activites-sportives/balades-et-randonnees-pedestres/tous-les-itineraires-de-randonnee-et-les-balades/tsenelle-verbier-fr-3491286/">Verbier - Tsenelle</a>. Official GPX geometry, simplified to 8 m.</i>]]></description>
