  <Placemark>
    <name>Verbier: Wouaiy</name>
    <description><![CDATA[2.7 km red downhill trail. Sinuous forest trail from below Les Ruinettes to the Medran gondola. The upper half is fairly steep, while the lower half becomes more flowing; it suits both downhill and enduro bikes. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.verbier.ch/decouvrir/explore-activites/activites-sportives/balades-et-randonnees-pedestres/tous-les-itineraires-de-randonnee-et-les-balades/wouaiy-verbier-fr-2794123/">Verbier - Wouaiy</a>. Official GPX geometry, simplified to 8 m.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#line-red</styleUrl>
