  <Placemark>
    <name>Villard: Glovettes</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Cote 2000 - top of the gondola</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A proper DH and enduro area on the Villard-Correncon domain, reached by the Cote 2000 gondola. Limestone plateau riding with big open pasture up top and steep wooded sections lower down - less alpine than Belledonne, more technical than it looks. The Vercors weather is its own thing: it can be clagged in here while Chamrousse bakes.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Usually the first bike park in France to open, in early June. Weekends in June and September, then daily 5 July to 31 August, 9:00-17:00. The operator publishes a summer price grid at villardcorrencon.com, budget in line with its neighbours, roughly 20-25 EUR a day.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 5 July; closed from 1 September (published 2026 dates).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Published operating hours; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Grenoble</td><td>Car</td><td>~45 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.villarddelans-correnconenvercors.com/">Villard-Correncon</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-gray</styleUrl>
    <Point><coordinates>5.563000,45.049700,1207</coordinates></Point>
