  <Placemark>
    <name>La Robella Bike Park [magic pass, from 27 CHF]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Buttes 780 m - valley station of the Buttes-La Robella chairlift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>The lift serves La Carabosse, an official difficult downhill to Buttes: 3 km and 480 m of descent, including around 2 km of technical singletrack with jumps and obstacles. The station also suggests several unmarked touring and e-MTB loops; its blue, red and black all-terrain scooter routes are not MTB downhill trails.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Chairlift access. The adult bike day pass is 27 CHF and bike transport is free. Magic Pass is accepted.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Typically open from mid-May to late October, with daily operation in peak summer and reduced opening outside it. Check the current schedule and conditions.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Lausanne</td><td>Train + bus</td><td>~1h30</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.robella.ch/downhill/">La Robella downhill</a>, <a href="https://www.robella.ch/tarifs/">official prices</a> and <a href="https://schweizmobil.ch/en/mountainbiking-in-switzerland/route-10004">SwitzerlandMobility</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
