  <Placemark>
    <name>Weissenstein (Solothurn) [gondola, from 38 CHF]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Oberdorf 670 m - valley station of the Weissensteinbahn gondola</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Natural, technical freeride/enduro descent running down the Weissenstein mountain toward Oberdorf. Steep gradient, tight switchbacks, slick forest soil, exposed roots, and limestone rock features. Best suited for advanced riders who appreciate raw mountain trails.<br/><br/><b>Rain sensitivity</b><br/>Rain-sensitive: slick forest soil and exposed roots become difficult quickly after rain.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Gondola access (Seilbahn Weissenstein). Bike single ride or day pass options available; day ticket is approximately 38-48 CHF (including bike transport).<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from May; closed from late October (subject to trail weather conditions and snow melt).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Lausanne</td><td>Train</td><td>~1h50</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.seilbahn-weissenstein.ch/">Seilbahn Weissenstein</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
