  <Placemark>
    <name>Thyon: Thyon - Veysonnaz (variant 1)</name>
    <description><![CDATA[7.5 km, +4/-785 m. A sustained descent from Thyon to Veysonnaz through the mayens. It follows an unpaved alpine road winding across high pastures, the Foret Noire and the Mayens de Veysonnaz. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.veysonnaz.ch/fr/V2725/itineraire-vtt-thyon-veysonnaz">Veysonnaz Tourisme - Thyon - Veysonnaz (variant 1)</a>. Official GPX geometry supplied by Veysonnaz Tourisme, simplified to 8 m.</i>]]></description>
