  <Placemark>
    <name>Le Suchet: Jougne - Suchet loop</name>
    <description><![CDATA[20.2 km difficult cross-border loop from Jougne to the 1588 m Suchet summit, with about 956 m of climbing and descent through forest and high pastures. The route is shared with hikers and is officially listed for MTB use; expect technical summit terrain and yield to walkers. <i>Source: <a href="https://explore.doubs.fr/trek/253-Suchet">Explore Doubs Rando</a>. Official GPX geometry, simplified to 8 m.</i>]]></description>
