  <Placemark>
    <name>Le Chasseron: Tour des Alpages</name>
    <description><![CDATA[22 km official MTB loop from Les Rasses through the wooded pastures and alpine chalets around the Chasseron massif. A more approachable alternative to Chasseron Bike, focused on scenic forest tracks and Jura pasture riding. <i>Source: <a href="https://bullet.ch/teams/parcours-vtt/">Commune of Bullet</a>. Official GPX geometry supplied by the Commune of Bullet, simplified to 8 m.</i>]]></description>
