  <Placemark>
    <name>Isola 2000 (Mercantour, Alpes-Maritimes) [lift pass, price unverified]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Isola 2000 1915 m - valley station of the Mercantour gondola</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>The highest of the Nice bike parks and the one with the widest spread: twelve marked descents, two green, four blue, four red and two black, split between the Pelevos sector under the gondola and the Lombarde sector reached by the Combe Grosse chairlift. Big open alpine terrain right on the Italian border, and a regular stop on the French Enduro Series.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Two lifts run in summer, the Mercantour gondola and the Combe Grosse detachable chairlift, both with bike racks. Open 4 July to 31 August 2026, plus the weekends of 20/21 and 27/28 June and 5/6 and 12/13 September. The bike day pass is not published online - the Mercantour season pass, valid here and at Auron, is 150 EUR. Ask the lift office for the day rate.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 4 July; closed from 1 September (published 2026 dates).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Nice</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h50</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.isola2000.com/en/summer/mountain-bike/">Isola 2000</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
