  <Placemark>
    <name>Jahorina Bike Park (Bosnia and Herzegovina) [lift pass]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Olympic Centre gravity trail above Poljice</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A resort-operated bike trail on the 1984 Olympic mountain, combining open alpine riding with forest and shaped gravity sections. The developing park is suitable for confident riders but has less documented progression terrain than the large Alpine resorts.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Summer resort uplift serves the bike trail when scheduled. Check Jahorina for the current lift, bike transport and ticket details.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 15 June; closed from 15 September (typical summer window).<br/>Daily opening hours: 10:00-16:00<br/><small>Estimated hours; verify that bike uplift is operating on the selected date.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Sarajevo</td><td>Car</td><td>~45 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.oc-jahorina.com/en/bike-staza/">Olympic Centre Jahorina</a>. Verify current summer operations.</i>]]></description>
