  <Placemark>
    <name>Niseko Grand Hirafu MTB Park (Hokkaido) [4000 JPY]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Ace gondola - lift-accessed flow above Hirafu</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A renewed 4.4 km intermediate-to-advanced flow trail descends the ski slopes, with berms, rollers and faster technical sections. A separate free skills area at the base provides beginner and intermediate progression terrain.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Ace gondola carries bikes. Adult day pass 4000 JPY, child 2500 JPY; adult season pass 30000 JPY. The skills area is free.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 4 July; closed from 28 September (published 2026 dates; September is weekends and holidays only, and 6 September is closed for an event).<br/>Daily opening hours: 08:30-16:00; last ascent 15:30<br/><small>Published 2026 schedule; check weather and trail status.</small><br/><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.grand-hirafu.jp/green/activities/mtb-park/">Niseko Tokyu Grand Hirafu</a>.
    Prices, schedules and conditions can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
