  <Placemark>
    <name>Nozawa Onsen MTB Park (Nagano) [gondola, price varies]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Nagasaka gondola - long gravity laps above Nozawa Onsen</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>About 10 km of downhill courses range from beginner and intermediate flow to advanced natural terrain, using the ski hill's large vertical and wooded lower slopes. Rentals are available at Nagasaka Center House.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Nagasaka gondola carries riders and bikes. The operator publishes ticket options seasonally; check the current MTB tariff before travelling.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 18 July; closed from 26 October (published 2026 dates). From 25 August to 17 September it is closed Tuesday, Wednesday and Thursday.<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-16:30; last gondola ascent 16:00<br/><small>Published 2026 schedule; weather closures are possible.</small><br/><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://en.nozawaski.com/summer/summer-activities/mtb/">Nozawa Onsen Mountain Resort</a>.
    Prices, schedules and conditions can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
