  <Placemark>
    <name>Pizol: top of the Pizolbahn</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Pizolhütte 2220 m - top of the Gaffia-Pizolhütte chairlift</b><br/><br/>
    Top station of the Pizolbahn, where the descents start. See the main Pizol pin for trails, prices and access.]]></description>
