  <Placemark>
    <name>Linga Longa Bike Park (Western Australia) [shuttle access]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Linga Longa 115 m - purpose-built gravity trails near Southampton</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A dedicated gravity bike park in the southwest region of Western Australia, featuring purpose-built downhill and flow trails. Located near Southampton, roughly 200 km south of Perth in the Margaret River wine region. Trail details and current operations should be verified locally before visiting.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Shuttle-based access; no fixed lift infrastructure. Check local trail groups or the Western Australian Mountain Bike Association for current access arrangements, pricing, and operating status.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Year-round access typical for Western Australia coastal climate. Confirm current trail status and any seasonal closures locally.<br/>Daily opening hours: daylight hours<br/><small>Check local conditions and access arrangements before visiting.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Perth</td><td>Car</td><td>~2h30</td></tr><tr><td>Margaret River</td><td>Car</td><td>~30 min</td></tr><tr><td>Bunbury</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/node/7385749283">OpenStreetMap</a>. Trail status, access and operations are not formally documented; verify locally before travel.</i>]]></description>
