  <Placemark>
    <name>Carezza - Val d'Ega / Eggental (South Tyrol) [lift pass, price unverified]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Nova Levante 1190 m - valley station of the Laurin 1 chairlift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>The Carezza Trail is the draw: 4.4 km and more than 500 m of descent from the top of the village cable car back down to Nova Levante, mixing steep turns, northshores, banked curves and jumps, and rideable by most people who can already ride. A training bike-park with a pumptrack, switchbacks, a jumpline and balance northshores sits at the top station, with a second one at Deutschnofen, and the Rosengarten fills the skyline the whole way down.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Laurin 1 gondola from the middle of Nova Levante at 1190 m carries bikes to the trailhead. The operator had not published a 2026 bike rate when this was compiled - the neighbouring Obereggen lifts charge a 6 EUR bike supplement on a 22 EUR return, which gives an idea of the order. Check eggental.com.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 23 May; closed from 2 November (published 2026 dates). Dates are the lift company's summer season.<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Bolzano</td><td>Car</td><td>~35 min</td></tr><tr><td>Trento</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h20</td></tr></table><br/><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://eggental.com/en">Eggental</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
