  <Placemark>
    <name>Bike Park Czarna Gora (PL) [119 PLN weekdays]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Czarna Gora 1205 m - one of Poland's largest lift-served parks</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Nineteen maintained trails cover beginner flow, skills zones, freeride, enduro and advanced downhill. The Kids and Skills arenas make progression unusually accessible, while the steeper race lines provide serious rock, roots and technical features.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Luxtorpeda chairlift and Efka lift carry bikes. The published 2026 adult weekday day pass is 119 PLN; weekend pricing can be higher.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 1 May; closed from 1 November (typical 2026 lift window; reduced schedules and maintenance closures apply).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Wroclaw</td><td>Car</td><td>~2h00</td></tr><tr><td>Prague</td><td>Car</td><td>~3h00</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.bikeparkczarnagora.pl/">official Bike Park Czarna Gora site</a>; check lift status.</i>]]></description>
