  <Placemark>
    <name>Le Grand-Bornand: La Virolo</name>
    <description><![CDATA[4.6 km. A compact marked enduro itinerary with banked turns and a descending profile, accessible to intermediate riders. <i>Source and geometry: <a href="https://www.legrandbornand.com/quoi-faire/la-virolo-itineraire-vtt-enduro-n34-le-grand-bornand-fr-5596134/">official trail page</a>.</i>]]></description>
