    <name>Manigod: Cabri</name>
    <description><![CDATA[1.6 km. A moderate descent from Tete de Cabeau to Col de la Croix Fry, passing beneath the Cabeau chairlift. <i>Source and geometry: <a href="https://www.manigod.com/descente-cabri/manigod.html">official trail page</a>.</i>]]></description>
