    <description><![CDATA[0.8 km. A short advanced descent from Tete de Cabeau to the foot of the Cabeau chairlift. <i>Source and geometry: <a href="https://www.manigod.com/descente-vautour/manigod.html">official trail page</a>.</i>]]></description>
