  <Placemark>
    <name>Manigod: Gypaete</name>
    <description><![CDATA[1.2 km. The park's expert descent from Tete de Cabeau to the foot of the Cabeau chairlift. <i>Source and geometry: <a href="https://www.manigod.com/descente-la-gypaete/manigod.html">official trail page</a>.</i>]]></description>
