  <Placemark>
    <name>Klangon Merapi DH (Yogyakarta, ID) [no lift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Klangon Hill on Mount Merapi - volcanic downhill track</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A recognised downhill competition venue at roughly 1,100 m, with fast, technical dirt and volcanic surfaces under a dramatic view of active Mount Merapi. It is a compact local track, not a large lift-served resort.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No public uplift was verified; push or pedal and ask locally about event-day vehicle access. A small general tourism or maintenance fee may apply.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open year-round subject to rain and volcanic exclusion zones. <br/>Daily opening hours: 06:00-18:00<br/><small>Typical daylight estimate; check weather and volcanic closures locally.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Yogyakarta</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://visitingjogja.jogjaprov.go.id/en/17059/klangon-hill-the-best-spot-to-enjoy-the-view-of-the-summit-of-mount-merapi/">Yogyakarta Tourism Portal</a>. Obey all Merapi safety closures.</i>]]></description>
