  <Placemark>
    <name>Mangsang Bike Park (Batam, ID) [uplift price unverified]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Bukit Mangsang, Batam - downhill and enduro race park</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A gravity-focused local park with downhill, enduro and XC competition tracks, including steep race sections and a substantial rock garden. It hosted Indonesian national-level MTB competition and draws riders from Singapore and Malaysia.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Local packages use vehicle uplift, but no current walk-up schedule or price was verified. Contact the park before taking the ferry with a bike.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open year-round subject to tropical rain and events. <br/>Daily opening hours: 08:00-17:00<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; arrange current access and uplift before arrival.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Batam Centre</td><td>Car</td><td>~35 min</td></tr><tr><td>Singapore</td><td>Ferry + car</td><td>~2h30</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://dispora.batam.go.id/2024/07/09/penutupan-indonesia-mountain-bike-national-championship/">Batam sports authority</a> and <a href="https://www.antaranews.com/video/4004334/99-atlet-dari-lima-negara-berpacu-di-arena-sepeda-gunung-batam">ANTARA</a>.</i>]]></description>
