  <Placemark>
    <name>Mount Kinabalu Foothills Adventure MTB (Sabah, MY) [guided, no lift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Kundasang and the Crocker Range foothills - Borneo adventure riding</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Highland farm roads, village tracks and rainforest connectors offer scenic XC and guided adventure riding beneath Mount Kinabalu. This is not a formal bike park, and national-park hiking trails must not be assumed legal for bicycles.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No lift. Use a local cycling operator for vehicle support, permission and a legal route; do not enter protected footpaths without approval.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Rideable year-round, with February-April usually drier. Tropical storms and mud can close or damage routes quickly.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Kota Kinabalu</td><td>Guide vehicle</td><td>~2h</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Indicative regional adventure-riding pin. Confirm a permitted route with a Sabah operator and protected-area authorities.</i><br/><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://sabahtourism.com/">Sabah Tourism</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
