  <Placemark>
    <name>Duolemeidi Bike Park (Chongli, CN) [lift status unverified]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Duolemeidi ski area - established Chongli downhill network</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Mapped green, blue and black singletrack includes sustained descents such as Big Brother, dropping roughly 350 m through open ski terrain and forest. Current maintenance and public summer uplift must be confirmed before travel.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The ski resort has lift infrastructure, but a current 2026 bicycle uplift schedule and price were not verified.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Potential summer season June-September. <br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-16:30<br/><small>Typical estimate; confirm current bike-park and uplift operation.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Beijing</td><td>Fast train + taxi</td><td>~2h30</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: mapped trail records for Chongli. Current operator status is unverified.</i>]]></description>
