  <Placemark>
    <name>Fenghuang Mountain Greenway (Shenzhen, CN) [no lift, free]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Fenghuang Mountain Forest Park - official mountain greenway</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A 9.1 km mountain route combining forest road, hiking-road and waterfront terrain. It has hosted national mountain-bike challenges, but it is more greenway and XC challenge than technical bike park.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Free pedal access; no lift. Stay on routes where cycling is permitted and respect busy pedestrian sections.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open year-round subject to storms and park notices. Daily opening hours: 07:00-19:00.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Central Shenzhen</td><td>Metro + taxi/bike</td><td>~1h</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.sz.gov.cn/en_szgov/news/infocus/park/szld/content/post_10945022.html">Shenzhen Government Online</a>.</i>]]></description>
