  <Placemark>
    <name>Bike Resort Sinaia (Romania) [gondola]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Romania's first official gondola-served bike resort</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Four downhill, all-mountain and XC routes total about 10 km between Cota 1400 and the lower gondola, including Easy Breezy and Fairy Trail. The upper Cota 2000 sector is not part of the prepared MTB network.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Sinaia gondola section 1000-1400 provides bike uplift. Check the daily cableway programme and bike tariff before riding.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Typical May-October operation, subject to gondola maintenance, wind and wet-trail closures. <br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Typical summer estimate; check the official gondola programme.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Bucharest</td><td>Train / car</td><td>~1h45</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://sinaiago.ro/bike-resort/">official Bike Resort Sinaia</a>.</i>]]></description>
