  <Placemark>
    <name>BOC Ponca Downhill (Arkansas) [40 USD shuttle]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Buffalo Outdoor Center, Ponca 324 m - shuttle base for the Ponca Downhill trails, Arkansas</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Over 11 miles of gravity trail above the Buffalo National River, with some of the longest downhill runs in Arkansas - descents of up to 1300 vertical feet. The downhill-specific lines suit intermediate and expert riders; one multi-directional trail can be ridden up or down and works for intermediates.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/><b>No lift - shuttle.</b> The Buffalo Outdoor Center runs a shuttle to the top seven days a week, 08:30-16:30: 40 USD for a full day or 20 USD for a half day. <b>The trail network itself is free and open to the public.</b> No reservation needed except for large groups.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>The riding season, roughly spring to late autumn.<br/>Daily opening hours: 08:30-16:30<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Ponca</td><td>Walk</td><td>At the centre</td></tr><tr><td>Harrison</td><td>Car</td><td>~40 min</td></tr><tr><td>Fayetteville</td><td>Car</td><td>~1 h 30</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.buffaloriver.com/biking/ponca-downhill-mtb-trail/">Buffalo Outdoor Center - Ponca Downhill MTB trail</a> and <a href="https://www.oztrails.com/trail-locations/boc-ponca-downhill-trails/">OZ Trails - BOC Ponca Downhill</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
