  <Placemark>
    <name>Northstar Bike Park - Truckee (California) [99 USD]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Northstar Village 1928 m - valley station of the Big Springs Gondola, Truckee, California</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Northern California's largest bike park, with 34 mapped trails and a reputation built on machine-built jump lines rather than raw mountain. Livewire is the one everyone comes for - a fast, flowing intermediate-to-advanced run of berms, tabletops and jumps that rides like a roller coaster, and which was rebuilt over a recent offseason. Around it sits a full progression from green flow to serious double black.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Big Springs Gondola and connecting chairlifts. Day tickets around 99 USD, with a season pass at about 598 USD - if you plan more than six days, the pass pays.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Thursday to Sunday 10:00-17:00 through the summer, with Mondays added from late June and Friday evening sessions 17:00-19:00 from early July.<br/>Daily opening hours: 10:00-17:00<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Truckee</td><td>Car</td><td>~15 min</td></tr><tr><td>Lake Tahoe north shore</td><td>Car</td><td>~20 min</td></tr><tr><td>Reno</td><td>Car</td><td>~50 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.northstarcalifornia.com/explore-the-resort/activities-and-events/summer-activities/bike-and-hike/mountain-biking.aspx">Northstar California - mountain biking</a> and <a href="https://www.sierrasun.com/news/northstar-bike-park-opens-for-summer-season-friday/">Sierra Sun - Northstar bike park season</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
