  <Placemark>
    <name>Purgatory Bike Park - Durango (Colorado) [49 USD]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Purgatory base 2679 m - valley station of the bike-park chairlift, Durango, Colorado</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>14 lift-served descents covering everything from beginner flow to World Cup downhill terrain. Divinity is the flow trail and the reason most people come - berms, jumps and wallrides, and the only chairlift-served flow trail in La Plata County - but the park also holds proper race-grade steeps.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>A chairlift serves the park. Adult day ticket 49 USD online or 59 USD at the window, 39 USD online for ages 13-17, and under-12s ride free. Sunset Shred gives three hours from 16:00 to 19:00 for 25 USD.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Thursday to Sunday 10:00-17:00 through mid-August, then Friday to Sunday until early October.<br/>Daily opening hours: 10:00-17:00<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Durango</td><td>Car</td><td>~40 min</td></tr><tr><td>Albuquerque</td><td>Car</td><td>~4 h</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.purgatory.ski/bike-park-tickets-passes/">Purgatory Resort - bike park tickets and passes</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
