  <Placemark>
    <name>Farside Bike Park - Chestnut Mountain (Illinois) [check operator]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Chestnut Mountain base 184 m - valley station of the Apache Quad, Galena, Illinois</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Illinois's only lift-served downhill park and one of the largest in the Midwest: four black trails, three blues, two greens and a skills course, on a bluff above the Mississippi eight miles from Galena. Modest vertical, but the trail building is serious and the setting above the river is unusual for the region.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Apache Quad. Lifts run Fridays 16:00-20:00 and Saturdays and Sundays 10:00-16:00; check the resort for current ticket rates.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>May through October, weekends and holidays.<br/>Daily opening hours: 10:00-16:00<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Galena</td><td>Car</td><td>~15 min</td></tr><tr><td>Dubuque</td><td>Car</td><td>~30 min</td></tr><tr><td>Chicago</td><td>Car</td><td>~3 h</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.chestnutmtn.com/activity/farside-bike-park/">Chestnut Mountain - Farside Bike Park</a> and <a href="https://downhillmidwest.com/farside-bike-park/">Downhill Midwest - Farside Bike Park</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
