  <Placemark>
    <name>Giants Ridge Bike Park (Minnesota) [check operator]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Giants Ridge base 431 m - valley station of the Sarajevo Express, Biwabik, Minnesota</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>10 lift-served gravity trails graded green to double black, with berms, jumps, rollers and rock gardens, plus 9.2 miles of purpose-built cross-country singletrack through the Superior National Forest, and two enduro-style trails added in 2026 aimed at intermediate and advanced riders. On-site dining, lodging and rental fleet.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Sarajevo Express chairlift. Tickets are cheap by bike-park standards; check the resort's rates.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Late spring through to early autumn.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Biwabik</td><td>Car</td><td>~5 min</td></tr><tr><td>Duluth</td><td>Car</td><td>~1 h 15</td></tr><tr><td>Minneapolis</td><td>Car</td><td>~3 h 30</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.giantsridge.com/mountain-biking/">Giants Ridge - mountain biking</a> and <a href="https://www.ridetherange.com/locations/giants-ridge/">Ride the Range - Giants Ridge</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
