  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Highland Mountain Bike Park (New Hampshire) [68-82 USD]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Highland Mountain 267 m - valley station of the bike-park chairlift, Northfield, New Hampshire</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>The first lift-accessed mountain built for bikes and nothing else - no ski season, no shared use, just a hill dedicated to riding. The reputation rests on meticulously maintained machine-built jump trails, a world-class slopestyle course and expert freeride lines such as NE Style and the Claymore competition terrain, alongside technical New England singletrack and green learning terrain. A 9100 sq ft indoor training centre and a 50-by-50 ft airbag back the coaching and progression programme, which is as much the product as the trails.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>A chairlift serves the park, with a surface lift in the Central Park zone. Adult walk-up day passes are 68 USD midweek and 82 USD at weekends and holidays; juniors aged 7-14 pay 34 USD and 41 USD. Season passes are also sold.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 23 April; closed from 16 November - the longest riding season in the Northeast.<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Core hours shown; Wednesdays are uphill-only evening sessions, Fridays run later in spring and summer, operating days reduce outside peak season and late fall closes at 16:00. Check the detailed calendar.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Concord</td><td>Car</td><td>~20 min</td></tr><tr><td>Manchester, NH</td><td>Car</td><td>~35 min</td></tr><tr><td>Boston</td><td>Car</td><td>~1 h 30</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.highlandmountain.com/">Highland Mountain Bike Park</a> and <a href="https://highlandmountain.com/explore-highland/plan-your-visit/passes-rates-hours/">Highland Mountain - passes, rates and hours</a> (2026 rates). Pin on <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/307145489">OSM way 307145489</a>, the lower end of the chairlift. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
