  <Placemark>
    <name>Mountain Creek Bike Park (New Jersey) [check operator]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Mountain Creek base 178 m - valley station of the bike-park gondola, Vernon, New Jersey</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>52 trails and over 40 miles, from machine-groomed cruisers to fall-line downhill that has hosted World Cup racers - the biggest and most serious park within reach of New York City. The gondola climbs 1040 ft in six minutes, and the lap time is short enough that riders regularly log more than 30,000 vertical feet in a day.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>A high-speed gondola. Day tickets and season passes on the resort's bike park pages.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>April to October - one of the longest seasons in the East.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Vernon</td><td>Car</td><td>~5 min</td></tr><tr><td>New York City</td><td>Car</td><td>~1 h 15</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.mountaincreek.com/bike-park">Mountain Creek Bike Park</a> and <a href="https://mountaincreek.com/bike-park/tickets-passes/season-passes/">Mountain Creek - bike season passes</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl>
    <Point><coordinates>-74.504044,41.190548,178</coordinates></Point>
    <ExtendedData xmlns:mwm="https://omaps.app">
      <Data name="spot"><value>us-mountain-creek-bike-park</value></Data>
