  <Placemark>
    <name>Greek Peak Bike Park - Cortland (New York) [35-38 USD]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Greek Peak base 385 m - valley station of the Visions Quad, Cortland, New York</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>20 trails and growing, graded green through double black, on a resort in central New York that has built out a full summer operation around them. The greens are deliberately scenic and gentle for people new to the sport; the blues bring technical ground and small features; the blacks go properly steep.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Visions Quad carries riders and bikes to the top. Day tickets around 38 USD on Saturdays and 35 USD on Sundays; downhill bike rental 100 USD a day.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>The warmer months.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Cortland</td><td>Car</td><td>~15 min</td></tr><tr><td>Syracuse</td><td>Car</td><td>~45 min</td></tr><tr><td>Ithaca</td><td>Car</td><td>~35 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.greekpeak.net/bike-park/">Greek Peak Bike Park</a> and <a href="https://www.greekpeak.net/activities/">Greek Peak - activities</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
