  <Placemark>
    <name>Blue Mountain Bike Park (Pennsylvania) [58 USD]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Blue Mountain base 139 m - valley station of the Comet Quad, Palmerton, Pennsylvania</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Pennsylvania's only lift-served bike park: 30 downhill trails on 1082 ft of vertical, running from beginner-friendly flow through technical singletrack to jump lines. The vertical is real by mid-Atlantic standards and the trail count means you can spend a full day without repeating.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The high-speed Comet Quad. Adult ticket 58 USD for 16 and over, youth 45 USD for 15 and under, season pass 369 USD. Rentals, protective gear, repairs and introductory lessons on site.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Late May through to early November.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Palmerton</td><td>Car</td><td>~10 min</td></tr><tr><td>Allentown</td><td>Car</td><td>~40 min</td></tr><tr><td>Philadelphia</td><td>Car</td><td>~1 h 30</td></tr><tr><td>New York City</td><td>Car</td><td>~1 h 45</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.skibluemt.com/mountain-biking/tickets-and-rentals/">Blue Mountain Resort - mountain biking tickets and rentals</a> and <a href="https://www.skibluemt.com/outdoor/mountain-biking/">Blue Mountain Resort - mountain biking</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
