  <Placemark>
    <name>Snowbasin Bike Park (Utah) [39 USD]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Littlecat base 2051 m - valley station of the Littlecat Express, Snowbasin, Utah</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A small, new park - four trails of different grades off the Littlecat Express, with about 200 ft of descent, opened in 2026 and built as a progression venue rather than a big-mountain descent. The wider reason to come is the Needles Gondola, which opens a multi-use network connecting to nearly 50 miles of cross-country terrain across the northern Wasatch.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Littlecat Express serves the bike park; the Needles Gondola runs Saturdays and Sundays 09:00-16:00 for the upper mountain. Bike-park tickets 39 USD adult, 29 USD child.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Weekends 10:00-17:00 from late June through to mid-October, plus Sunset Social sessions on Thursdays 16:00-20:00 from early July to late September.<br/>Daily opening hours: 10:00-17:00<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Ogden</td><td>Car</td><td>~30 min</td></tr><tr><td>Salt Lake City</td><td>Car</td><td>~1 h</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.snowbasin.com/activities/mountain-biking/">Snowbasin - mountain biking</a> and <a href="https://www.snowbasin.com/blog/article/summer-offerings-2026/">Snowbasin - 2026 summer offerings</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
