  <Placemark>
    <name>Valparaiso Cerro Abajo (Chile) [urban DH event course]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>The original Red Bull Cerro Abajo urban downhill</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Event</b><br/>Valparaiso turns its steep hills, narrow alleys, staircases, rooftops and historic funicular corridors into the world's best-known urban downhill course. The 22nd edition ran on 15 February 2026, descending from Cerro Carcel toward Plaza Anibal Pinto through nearly 280 steps, wallrides, drops and temporary jumps.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No uplift and no permanent marked race trail. Spectating is free during the event; outside race weekend these are public city streets and stairs, not a sanctioned MTB course.<br/><br/><p class="warn">&#9888;&#65039; The race line and artificial features exist only under event control. Do not attempt the course outside an authorized event.</p>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>The documented 2026 event ran on 15 February. There is no public riding season.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Santiago</td><td>Bus / car</td><td>~1h45</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.redbull.com/cl-es/events/red-bull-valparaiso-cerro-abajo-2026">official 2026 event page</a> and <a href="https://www.redbull.com/us-en/event-series/red-bull-cerro-abajo/red-bull-cerro-abajo-format">official series format</a>.</i>]]></description>
