  <Placemark>
    <name>Genova Cerro Abajo (Italy) [urban DH event course]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Red Bull Cerro Abajo from Monte Peralto to the old city</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Event</b><br/>The 2026 urban downhill dropped 279 m over 2.2 km from the Righi funicular top station at Monte Peralto to Largo della Zecca. Racers threaded ancient creuze and caruggi, staircases, tight bends, wallrides, drops and temporary obstacles. The 2026 edition ran on 27-28 June.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Righi funicular reaches the start area, but it is not a bike uplift for a permanent race trail. Spectating is free during the event.<br/><br/><p class="warn">&#9888;&#65039; This is an event-only course through public streets. Artificial features and a closed race line are not available for normal riding.</p>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>The documented 2026 event ran on 27-28 June. There is no public riding season.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Genova Piazza Principe</td><td>Walk + funicular</td><td>~25 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.redbull.com/us-en/events/red-bull-genova-cerro-abajo-2026">official 2026 event page</a> and <a href="https://www.redbull.com/it-it/videos/red-bull-genova-cerro-abajo-percorso">official course overview</a>.</i>]]></description>
