  <Placemark>
    <name>Huagal Bike Park (Oxapampa, Peru) [booking required]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Casa Huagal 2126 m - boutique gravity park in the Oxapampa cloud forest, Peru</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Five downhill lines and a cross-country loop cut into 154 hectares of private conservation land in the high jungle. La Suiza is the longest at 2.2 km, with Into the Wild at 1.30 km, Cuarzo Trail at 1.23 km and La Red Carpet alongside it - the published lines are all graded intermediate - plus a 4 km XCO loop. The trails were laid out by the Colombian Tacky builders to work with steep cloud-forest ground, and the site covers downhill, enduro, cross-country and e-MTB.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/><b>No lift.</b> There is no public lift and no walk-up day rate: riding is booked through the lodge, which is what the site is built around. Contact Huagal in advance to arrange riding, accommodation and transport.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open year round with no published seasonal closure. Heavy tropical rain can close or damage trails, so confirm conditions before travelling.<br/>Daily opening hours: 08:00-17:00<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Oxapampa</td><td>Car, 19 km</td><td>~45 min</td></tr><tr><td>Lima</td><td>Car</td><td>~9 h</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.huagal.pe/bike-park/">Huagal - bike park</a> and <a href="https://www.huagal.pe/">Casa Huagal</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
