    <name>Chiche Trails (Tumbaco, Ecuador) [check operator]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Purpose-built trail park in the Rio Chiche valley</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A family-oriented park covering XC, enduro and dirt-jump riding, with progression terrain intended for beginners through advanced riders. The warm valley setting makes it an accessible gravity and skills option near Quito.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No lift or current public admission price is published. Contact the operator for opening days, booking and access from El Arenal.<br/><br/>
