  <Placemark>
    <name>Guagualzhumi Bike Park (Paccha, Ecuador) [check operator]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>High-Andean bike park above Cuenca</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Enduro and cross-country terrain around Cerro Guagualzhumi, with steep highland paths and locally built race lines. The exposed summit area reaches roughly 3080 m, so weather can change quickly.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No mechanical lift or current admission price is published. Contact Ciclorutas for access, guiding and the usable trail network.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 1 January with no published seasonal closure.<br/>Daily opening hours: 08:00-17:00<br/><small>Estimated daylight window; verify land access and weather locally.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Cuenca</td><td>Car</td><td>~35 min</td></tr></table><br/>
