  <Placemark>
    <name>Suior Bike Park (Baia Sprie, Romania) [chairlift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Lift-assisted downhill in the Maramures mountains</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Several prepared downhill lines descend from the Suior ski area through forest and open ski terrain. The riding is steep and gravity-focused, with technical roots, turns and natural surfaces suited mainly to experienced riders.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The chairlift carries bikes on dedicated racks. A current public summer bike ticket price is not published; confirm lift operation and payment directly with the resort before travelling.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 1 June; closed from 1 October (estimated summer season).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Dates and hours are estimates; summer lift operation can be event- or demand-dependent.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Baia Sprie</td><td>Car</td><td>~15 min</td></tr><tr><td>Baia Mare</td><td>Car</td><td>~35 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.turismbaiasprie.ro/en/destinatie/downhill">Baia Sprie tourism downhill page</a> and <a href="https://suior.ro/activitati/">official Suior activities page</a>. Confirm current trail and chairlift status with the resort.</i>]]></description>
