  <Placemark>
    <name>Cheile Gradistei Bikepark (Fundata, Romania) [ski lift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Progressive lift-served park in the Bran highlands</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Color-graded routes range from a green beginner line to a black downhill line, with blue and red progression in between. The ski lift uses easyLOOP bike carriers, making this one of Romania's clearer purpose-built gravity options for mixed abilities.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Bike uplift uses the resort ski lift. Current bike-park tickets and the live summer timetable are not published consistently in English; check with Cheile Gradistei before arrival.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 1 June; closed from 1 October (estimated summer season).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Estimated operating window; weather and resort programming can alter lift access.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Bran</td><td>Car</td><td>~30 min</td></tr><tr><td>Brasov</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.cheilegradistei.ro/en/sports-activities/ciclism">official Cheile Gradistei cycling page</a>. Confirm lift days, ticket price and trail status with the resort.</i>]]></description>
