  <Placemark>
    <name>Paltinis Arena Downhill (Romania) [check uplift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Technical forest downhill above Sibiu</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Paltinis Arena publishes dedicated downhill trails with steep forest sections, natural roots and technical features. It is strongest for experienced gravity riders, while the wider Arena Platos area also offers easier cycling activities.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Summer uplift and bike transport are not clearly guaranteed on every operating day. Contact the resort for the current lift arrangement, bike acceptance and ticket price.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 1 June; closed from 1 October (estimated summer season).<br/>Daily opening hours: 10:00-17:00<br/><small>Estimated bike-operation window; verify before travelling.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Sibiu</td><td>Car</td><td>~45 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://paltinisarena.ro/vara/activitati/downhill-trails.html">official Paltinis Arena downhill page</a>. Confirm current uplift and trail conditions with the operator.</i>]]></description>
