  <Placemark>
    <name>Vatra Dornei: Veverita base 850 m</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>First bike park in north-east Romania, Moldavia's Bukovina highlands</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>The Family Line (1,490 m, 180 m drop) starts at Veverita summit and is a beginner-friendly flow descent through scenic Carpathian forest. Seven trails are planned by 2027 across the Veverita, Parc and Dealu Negru sectors, adding progression options.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Teleschi Veverita carries bikes on Easy LOOP carriers. Multi-run tickets only: 2 runs 15 RON, 5 runs 35 RON, 12 runs 60 RON, 25 runs 100 RON. Groups of 10+ available Mon-Thu on request.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 1 June; closed from 1 October (estimated summer season).<br/>Daily opening hours: Fri 12:00-17:00, Sat-Sun 10:00-17:00<br/><small>Published 2026 hours; Mon-Thu by reservation for groups of 10+.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Vatra Dornei</td><td>Bike / car</td><td>~5 min</td></tr><tr><td>Suceava</td><td>Car</td><td>~2h</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://redescopera-taradornelor.ro/bike-park-vatra-dornei/">official Vatra Dornei Bike Park page</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
