  <Placemark>
    <name>Malino Brdo Bike Park (Ruzomberok, Slovakia) [gondola]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Long forest descents above Ruzomberok</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>One of Slovakia's established mountain-bike centers, with lift-accessed forest riding and a mix of flowing and technical gravity terrain. Check the current trail page carefully because the officially maintained bike-park network and wider mapped forest routes do not always have the same status.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Hrabovo-Malino Brdo gondola carries riders and bikes during summer operation. Current bike tickets are sold by the resort.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 1 June; closed from 1 October (estimated summer season).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-16:30<br/><small>Estimated operating window; check the live gondola and trail status.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Ruzomberok centre</td><td>Bike / car</td><td>~10 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://skipark.sk/en/bike-park/trails/">official trail page</a> and <a href="https://skipark.sk/en/event/slovak-downhill-cup/">resort Downhill Cup page</a>. Use only trails shown as open.</i>]]></description>
