  <Placemark>
    <name>Kubinska Hola Bike Park (Slovakia) [chairlift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Flow, enduro and black downhill above Dolny Kubin</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>The published network includes the 4.2 km very difficult Bengal downhill, the 2.5 km difficult Gandalf enduro line, and the medium Super Mix and Mig Mig flow trails. That range makes Kubinska Hola useful for progression while retaining a serious expert descent.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The resort chairlift provides bike uplift during scheduled summer operation. Check the online price list and live operating calendar before arrival.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 1 June; closed from 1 October (estimated summer season).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-16:00<br/><small>Estimated lift window; weekend and holiday schedules may differ.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Dolny Kubin</td><td>Car</td><td>~15 min</td></tr></table><br/>
