  <Placemark>
    <name>Velka Raca Bike Park (Oscadnica, Slovakia) [chairlift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Five marked gravity trails at Dedovka</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>The resort publishes five marked downhill trails totaling about 10.6 km, including Enduro and Downhill PRO options. Expect forest roots, berms and technical sections, with routes for both progressing and expert riders.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Dedovka chairlift carries bikes during summer operation. Consult the resort price list and calendar for the current bike ticket.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 1 June; closed from 1 October (estimated summer season).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-16:00<br/><small>Estimated lift window; operating days can vary outside holidays.</small><br/><br/>
