  <Placemark>
    <name>Ponte de Lima Bike Park (Portugal) [no lift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Serra d'Arga downhill and enduro center</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A purpose-built mountain-bike center between Estoraos and Cabração offering downhill, enduro, cross-country and touring routes. The granite mountain terrain mixes open rocky sections with forest singletrack and has hosted national-level downhill competition.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No mechanical lift or current unified day ticket is published. Pedal the access roads or arrange vehicle transport with a local operator; confirm whether any park service or booking is required before arrival.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 1 January with no published seasonal closure.<br/>Daily opening hours: daylight only<br/><small>There is no verified daily uplift timetable. Heavy rain, forestry work, fire risk and events can change access.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Ponte de Lima</td><td>Car</td><td>~25 min</td></tr><tr><td>Porto</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h15</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.visitepontedelima.pt/pt/turismo/bike-park-de-ponte-de-lima/">official Ponte de Lima tourism page</a>. Confirm access, trail maintenance and any shuttle arrangement locally.</i>]]></description>
