    <name>Cilaos 1: La Merveilleuse</name>
    <description><![CDATA[6 km official ONF circuit through the Cilaos cirque. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.onf.fr/vivre-la-foret/+/15f7::reseau-de-pistes-vtt-et-vttae-du-cirque-de-cilaos.html">ONF - Cilaos VTT/VTTAE network</a>.</i>]]></description>
