  <Placemark>
    <name>Voss Bike Park (Norway) [gondola]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Voss Gondola top 820 m - home of Ekstremsportveko</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Norway's extreme sports capital, hosting the annual Ekstremsportveko festival. The gondola-served park has downhill and enduro trails with views over Voss lake and the surrounding fjords. Purpose-built lines range from blue flow to World-Cup-proven technical black descents.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Voss Gondola carries bikes from the town centre (50 m) to the top station at 820 m. Confirm the current bike ticket and season with Voss Resort.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from June; closed from October (estimated summer season).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Estimated hours; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Bergen</td><td>Train / car</td><td>~1h30</td></tr><tr><td>Voss centre</td><td>Gondola</td><td>~5 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.vossresort.no/">Voss Resort</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl>
    <Point><coordinates>6.421,60.629,62</coordinates></Point>
