  <Placemark>
    <name>Hemsedal Rides (Norway) [chairlift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Lift-served flow and technical riding above Hemsedal</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Hollvin Express serves the Hemsedal Rides network, including the long blue Silverstone descent, green Broadway connector and the more technical red High Line. Tottelia Bike Park at the resort base adds compact progression trails and skills features.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Hollvin Express carries bikes to roughly 1,150 m. A SkiStar BikePass is required; rental and instruction are available at the resort.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Published 2026 lift season: daily 27 June-16 August, plus selected September weekends and daily 26 September-4 October.<br/>Daily opening hours: 10:00-16:00<br/><small>Some autumn dates operate 11:00-15:00 or 11:00-16:00; check the live schedule and trail status.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Hemsedal centre</td><td>Bike / bus / car</td><td>~10 min</td></tr><tr><td>Oslo</td><td>Car / bus</td><td>~3h</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.skistar.com/en/ski-destinations/hemsedal/summer-in-hemsedal/activities/biking/">SkiStar Hemsedal biking</a>, <a href="https://www.skistar.com/no/vare-skisteder/hemsedal/sommer-i-hemsedal/oppettider/">official 2026 opening dates</a>. Pin marks the published Silverstone start near the lift top at 1,151 m.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl>
    <Point><coordinates>8.511480,60.848340,1136</coordinates></Point>
