  <Placemark>
    <name>Courmayeur Bike Park (Aosta Valley, IT) [cable car]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Courmayeur - lift-served gravity at the foot of Mont Blanc</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A cable-car-served bike park in the shadow of Mont Blanc with downhill and enduro lines through forest and alpine terrain. The Plan Checrouit area above Courmayeur offers one of the most spectacular backdrops in European mountain biking.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Courmayeur cable car carries bikes during summer operation. Check the current bike ticket and lift schedule with Courmayeur Mont Blanc before travelling.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from June; closed from September (estimated summer season).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Estimated hours; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Aosta</td><td>Car / bus</td><td>~45 min</td></tr><tr><td>Geneva</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h30</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.courmayeur-montblanc.com/">Courmayeur</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
