  <Placemark>
    <name>Sestriere Bike Park (Via Lattea, IT) [chairlift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Sestriere 2035 m - Via Lattea lift-served park</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Part of the Via Lattea (Milky Way) ski area shared with Sauze d'Oulx, Sestriere offers chairlift-served downhill and enduro trails at over 2000 m altitude. The high-alpine terrain and long descents toward the valley make it one of Piedmont's primary gravity destinations.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Chairlift access for bikes during summer operation. The Via Lattea bike pass may also cover neighbouring resorts. Confirm the current tariff with Sestriere before travelling.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from July; closed from August (short high-alpine summer window).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Estimated hours; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Turin</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h30</td></tr><tr><td>Oulx (TGV station)</td><td>Car / bus</td><td>~30 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.vialattea.it/en/summer/bike-park/">Via Lattea</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
