  <Placemark>
    <name>Limone Piemonte Bike Park (Piedmont, IT) [chairlift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Limone Piemonte - gravity park on the French border</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A well-established lift-served park in the Maritime Alps near the Col de Tende tunnel, with downhill and enduro lines through mixed forest. The park has hosted Italian national-level races and offers progression from green flow to black technical descents.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Chairlift carries bikes during summer operation. Check the current bike ticket with Limone Piemonte before travelling.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from June; closed from September (estimated summer season).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Estimated hours; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Turin</td><td>Car / train</td><td>~1h30</td></tr><tr><td>Nice</td><td>Car</td><td>~2h</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://riservabianca.it/">Limone Piemonte</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
