  <Placemark>
    <name>High1 Resort Bike Park (Gangwon-do, KR) [gondola]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>High1 - Korea's premier lift-served gravity park</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>South Korea's largest lift-served bike park with gondola access to multiple downhill and enduro trails through the Taebaek Mountains. Purpose-built progression from green flow to technical black DH, with regular national-level race events.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The resort gondola carries bikes during summer operation. Check the current bike ticket and season dates with High1 before travelling.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from June; closed from October (estimated summer season).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Estimated hours; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Seoul</td><td>Train / car</td><td>~3h</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.high1.com/">High1 Resort</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl>
    <Point><coordinates>128.724,37.221,928</coordinates></Point>
