    <description><![CDATA[<b>Yllas - Finland's largest ski resort with gondola-served riding</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Lapland's westernmost lift-served park with gondola and chairlift access to downhill and enduro trails through Arctic fell terrain. The midnight sun in June and July allows exceptionally long riding days above the Arctic Circle.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Yllas gondola carries bikes during the summer season. Confirm the current bike pass and lift schedule with Yllas before travelling.<br/><br/>
