    <name>Jay Peak Bike Park (Vermont, US) [tram/chairlift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Jay Peak Resort - the Northeast Kingdom's lift-served park</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Northern Vermont's lift-served gravity park with the iconic tram and chairlift providing uplift. Trails range from beginner flow to technical black diamond downhill through the Green Mountains, with the bonus of an indoor waterpark at the base for recovery.<br/><br/>
