  <Placemark>
    <name>Kicking Horse Bike Park (Golden, BC, CA) [gondola]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Kicking Horse Mountain Resort - world-class Canadian gravity</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>One of Canada's premier lift-served parks with the Golden Eagle Express gondola providing uplift from 1185 m to 2345 m. Ninety-plus trails span the full range from green flow to pro-line double-black technical descents, with 1200 m of vertical per lap. The resort also houses a grizzly bear refuge.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Golden Eagle Express gondola carries bikes during summer operation. Check the current bike ticket and schedule with Kicking Horse before travelling.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from June; closed from October (estimated summer season).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Estimated hours; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Golden</td><td>Car</td><td>~15 min</td></tr><tr><td>Calgary</td><td>Car</td><td>~3h</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://kickinghorseresort.com/">Kicking Horse</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
