  <Placemark>
    <name>Panorama Bike Park (Invermere, BC, CA) [chairlift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Panorama Mountain Resort - Purcell Mountains gravity park</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A well-established BC park with the Mile 1 Express chairlift serving downhill and enduro trails through the Purcells. Old-school technical lines combine with newer flow trails, plus an alpine zone for high-elevation riding.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Chairlift carries bikes during summer operation. Check the current bike ticket and schedule with Panorama before travelling.<br/><br/>
