    <description><![CDATA[<b>Mount Washington - Vancouver Island's lift-served gravity park</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>The only lift-served bike park on Vancouver Island with chairlift access to downhill and enduro trails through coastal forest. Panoramic views across the Strait of Georgia to the mainland, plus a dedicated skills park at the base.<br/><br/>
