    <name>Coronet Peak Bike Park (New Zealand) [chairlift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Coronet Peak - Queenstown's quick-access lift-served park</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Queenstown's original lift-served bike park, just 20 minutes from town with chairlift access to downhill and enduro trails through tussock and alpine terrain. Views across the Wakatipu basin and the Remarkables range. Summer operation during the southern hemisphere season.<br/><br/>
