  <Placemark>
    <name>Fourforty MTB Park (Waikato, New Zealand) [shuttle]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Fourforty MTB Park - purpose-built shuttle-served gravity park</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A dedicated commercial gravity park in the Waikato with shuttle-served downhill and enduro trails through pine forest. The park is built and maintained exclusively for mountain biking, with progressive jump lines, technical descents and a skills area.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Shuttle vehicle uplift included in the day pass. No mechanical lift; purpose-built shuttle road provides continuous laps. Check the current day pass price and schedule with Fourforty before travelling.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open year-round, closed during heavy rain or high fire risk.<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Estimated hours; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
