  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Bike Park Kranjska Gora (Julian Alps, SI) [day rate unverified]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Kranjska Gora 817 m - valley station, ticket office and the bottom of every line</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Around 25 marked lines and close to 20 km of riding packed into only 300 m of vertical, which makes for short laps and a lot of them. A green flow line is the way in, DH Veetranz is the more technical main descent, and two black sections cover the hard end - jumps and genuinely technical ground. Downhill and enduro bikes are rented from the log cabin at the base. The Julian Alps setting is the other half of the reason to come.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The resort chairlift from Kranjska Gora at 817 m. The day rate is set by the operator each season and is not published reliably in English - check before travel.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from mid-June; closed from late September (typical window; check the operator and conditions).<br/>Daily opening hours: 10:00-17:00<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Ljubljana</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h00</td></tr><tr><td>Villach</td><td>Car</td><td>~50 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://kranjska-gora.si/en/activities/bike-park-kranjska-gora">Kranjska Gora bike park</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl>
