    <name>Kaprun - Maiskogel and Kitzsteinhorn (Salzburg, AT) [35 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[MK Maiskogelbahn valley station in Kaprun, 765 m - the end of the Maiskogel Trail.]]></description>
