  <Placemark>
    <name>Antur Stiniog (Eryri / Snowdonia, Wales) [44 GBP]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Visitor centre and uplift pick-up at 270 m in Blaenau Ffestiniog - cafe, bike wash, showers, parking.]]></description>
