  <Placemark>
    <name>Madonna di Campiglio / Pinzolo Bike Area (Italy) [22 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Madonna di Campiglio / Pinzolo: Pinzolo valley station</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Lift-served bike area in the Brenta Dolomites around Madonna di Campiglio and Pinzolo. The area links 14 lift systems with bike transport, with 8 downhill trails (approx. 29 km), 13 enduro trails (approx. 206 km) and a large network of cross-country and e-bike routes. Named descents include Fogajard, Sentiero dell'Orso, Trail Cavradoss, Margun Degre and the tracciato downhill Tosa. The Pinzolo side (Doss Bike Area, formerly Brenta Bike Park) has been redesigned around beginner-friendly natural trails and a skill park.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The area sells per-ride tickets rather than an unlimited day pass. Adult return ticket for the main Campiglio uplifts (Pradalago / 5 Laghi / Spinale) is 22 EUR (27 EUR during high season 25 July - 30 August); bike transport supplement is 5 EUR. Online purchase discounts up to 15%. Children up to 8 years ride free.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Madonna di Campiglio lifts: 18 June - 20 September 2026. Pinzolo lifts: 20 June - 13 September 2026. Daily hours generally 08:30 - 17:20, with reduced midday closure at the start/end of season.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Trento</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h00</td></tr><tr><td>Pinzolo</td><td>Car / bus</td><td>~15 min</td></tr><tr><td>Dimaro-Folgarida station</td><td>Bus</td><td>~30 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.campigliodolomiti.it/en/outdoor/bike">Campiglio Dolomiti outdoor bike</a>, <a href="https://www.campigliodolomiti.it/en/skiarea-estiva/lifts-summer-opening-program">summer lift opening</a>, <a href="https://www.campigliodolomiti.it/en/bike/mappe-e-percorsi/campiglio-maps-and-routes">Campiglio maps and routes</a>, <a href="https://www.ski.it/en/activities/doss-bike-area">Doss Bike Area</a>, <a href="https://www.ski.it/en/ticket/family-discounts-ticket-reductions">ticket reductions</a> and <a href="https://www.dolomitibrentabike.it/it">Dolomiti Brenta Bike</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
