  <Placemark>
    <name>Terra na Veia Bike Park (Ceará) [30 BRL]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>783-hectare natural estate near Maranguape</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Northeast Brazil's premier MTB destination with approximately 30 km of purpose-built singletracks across more than 20 trails. Trail network ranges from beginner-friendly green routes to challenging black-diamond downhill and enduro lines. Features include fast berms, sequenced jump lines (notably Trilha 6b), rock gardens and wooden bridge crossings through native tropical vegetation.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No mechanical lift. Access is pedal-up or push-up through the climbing routes. Day-use pass approximately 30 BRL.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open year-round (Ceará's tropical climate provides consistent 12-month access).<br/>Daily opening hours: daylight hours<br/>
    <small>Operating hours vary; check park status before visiting.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access">
      <tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr>
      <tr><td>Fortaleza</td><td>Car</td><td>~40 min</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Maranguape</td><td>Car / bike</td><td>~15 min</td></tr>
    </table><br/>
    <i>Sources: Regional MTB network documentation and operator information. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
