  <Placemark>
    <name>Wentworth Bike Park (Nova Scotia, Canada) [chairlift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Wentworth 55 m - valley station of the Blue Quad</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>More than 40 km of gravity riding is split between the chairlift-served Lift Zone and the pedal-access Climb Zone. The network includes progressive flow, jumps and technical downhill trails, plus cross-country riding near the summit. Rentals, lessons and a downhill race series are available.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Blue Quad serves the Lift Zone. Published 2026 adult day tickets are CAD 55 in advance or CAD 60 on the day; separate lower-cost Climb Zone access is available.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Tentative 2026 lift season: 13 June through late October, Friday-Sunday and selected holidays.<br/><small>Weather and trail work can change lift and trail availability; check the live status before travelling.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Truro</td><td>Car</td><td>~35 min</td></tr><tr><td>Halifax</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h45</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.bikewentworth.ca/">official Bike Wentworth</a>, <a href="https://www.bikewentworth.ca/wentworth-mbp-lift-zone">2026 Lift Zone information</a>, <a href="https://www.bikewentworth.ca/single-and-multi-day-passes">2026 tickets</a> and <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/257025775">OSM Blue Quad lift</a> (ODbL). Pin marks the OSM lift top, verified at 283 m.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>-63.561383,45.609785,57</coordinates></Point>
    <ExtendedData xmlns:mwm="https://omaps.app"><Data name="spot"><value>ca-ns-wentworth</value></Data><Data name="tags"><value>beginner expert bike-park dh enduro freeride</value></Data><Data name="open_from"><value>06-13</value></Data><Data name="closed_from"><value>10-26</value></Data><mwm:icon>Transport</mwm:icon><mwm:visibility>1</mwm:visibility></ExtendedData>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Wentworth Bike Park: top of the Blue Quad</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Blue Quad top station 283 m - Nova Scotia's only lift-accessible bike park</b><br/><br/>
    Top station of the Blue Quad, where the descents start. See the main Wentworth Bike Park pin for trails, prices and access.]]></description>
