  <Placemark>
    <name>Pilatus: Pilatustrail</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>2.8 km technical natural trail</b><br/><br/>Named singletrack in the Pilatus area, with roots, tight turns and variable terrain. This is a natural mountain trail, not a maintained bike-park line.<br/><br/><i>Geometry simplified from <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/120875145">OpenStreetMap way 120875145</a> (ODbL). Lift and access context: <a href="https://www.pilatus.ch/en/">Pilatus Bahnen</a>. Confirm bike carriage and local trail restrictions before riding.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#line-trail</styleUrl>
