  <Placemark>
    <name>Marbachegg: Clientis Flowtrail</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>4.1 km flow trail</b><br/><br/>The main Marbachegg flow trail, descending through rollers, berms, jumps and technical features from the gondola station toward Marbach.<br/><br/><i>Geometry simplified from <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/relation/19994667">OpenStreetMap relation 19994667</a> (ODbL). Trail and lift context: <a href="https://www.marbachegg.ch/">Sportbahnen Marbachegg</a>. Follow local signs and current conditions.</i>]]></description>
