  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Valmorel Bike Park (Savoie) [21.20 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Valmorel 1345 m - valley station of the Planchamp gondola</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>27 marked runs split by discipline rather than lumped together, which is unusual and useful. Downhill: 2 green, 2 blue, 1 red, 1 black. Enduro: 2 green, 2 blue, 4 red. Cross-country: 1 green, 3 blue, 2 red, 2 black. Around that sits a wider network of 33 signed routes over more than 365 km, so a week here does not repeat itself. The village is car-free and purpose-built, which makes it an easy family base.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Five lifts run in summer. Planchamp and Pierrafort are the gondolas out of the Bourg at about 1345 m; Celliers and Combelouviere open the far side. Day pass 21.20 EUR, sold at the Bourg, at Doucy and at the foot of the Celliers gondola.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 20 June; closed from 1 September (typical window; check the operator and conditions).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:30-17:00<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Moutiers</td><td>Bus</td><td>~40 min</td></tr><tr><td>Geneva</td><td>Car</td><td>~2h15</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.valmorel.com/en/summer-activities/bikepark-mtb-cycling/mtb-area/">Valmorel bike area</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl>
    <Point><coordinates>6.441440,45.460910,1347</coordinates></Point>
    <ExtendedData xmlns:mwm="https://omaps.app">
      <Data name="spot"><value>valmorel</value></Data>
      <Data name="tags"><value>beginner expert bike-park dh enduro</value></Data>
      <Data name="open_from"><value>06-20</value></Data>
      <Data name="closed_from"><value>09-01</value></Data>
      <Data name="price_day"><value>21.20 EUR</value></Data>
      <mwm:icon>Mountain</mwm:icon>
      <mwm:visibility>1</mwm:visibility>
    </ExtendedData>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Valmorel: top of the Planchamp gondola</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Planchamp 1915 m - top of the gondola</b><br/><br/>Main entry into the downhill and enduro network. See the main Valmorel pin for trails, prices and access.]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-gray</styleUrl>
    <Point><coordinates>6.424250,45.449550,1917</coordinates></Point>
    <ExtendedData xmlns:mwm="https://omaps.app">
