  <Placemark>
    <name>Vogel - Bohinj (Julian Alps, SI) [33 EUR + 4 EUR per bike]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Ukanc 575 m - valley station of the Vogel cable car</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A small marked set rather than a built park - the listing counts three routes, one of them a blue - but the position is the draw: the cable car lifts you a clean 950 m off the shore of Lake Bohinj into the Triglav national park, and the descents run back down through forest to the lake. Chairlifts at the top (Orlove Glave, Sija) open the higher ground for enduro loops. Treat the grading on the ground as the authority; there is no published colour breakdown.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Vogel cable car from Ukanc at 575 m to 1535 m in four minutes, then the top-station chairlifts. Return ticket 33 EUR including parking, with bikes carried for 4 EUR each. Runs 08:00 to 19:00 in summer.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from June; closed from October (typical summer window; the cable car itself runs most of the year).<br/>Daily opening hours: 08:00-19:00<br/><small>Published cable-car hours; the top chairlifts keep shorter hours.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Bohinjska Bistrica</td><td>Bus</td><td>~25 min</td></tr><tr><td>Ljubljana</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h20</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://vogel.si/en/price-list-summer/">Vogel ski centre</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
