  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Civetta: top of the Pescul-Fertazza chairlift</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Fertazza 1845 m - top of the Pescul chairlift</b><br/><br/>Entry to the Val Fiorentina trails, with the second Fertazza chairlift continuing to 2070 m. See the main Civetta pin for trails, prices and access.]]></description>
