  <Placemark>
    <name>Bikepark Ochsenkopf (Fichtelgebirge, Germany) [22 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Warmensteinach 660 m - valley station of the Ochsenkopf north gondola</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>One serious downhill run of 2.3 km with several variants along it, plus a flow trail linking the bottom into the Bullhead House area, where the bike funpark has north shore, tables, wall rides and drops and a separate skills course grades its exercises from easy upwards. A big expansion is due mid-2026: four new flow trails, three single trails and an uphill trail, about 15 km in total, all easy to medium - which will change the balance of a park that has until now been aimed at experienced riders.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The north gondola from Warmensteinach at 660 m to 1010 m, about 14 minutes, with fold-down bubbles so the ride is bearable in bad weather; a south gondola serves the other side. Day ticket 22 EUR adult, 20 EUR youth, 18 EUR child.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from May; closed from the end of October (typical window; check the operator and conditions).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Bayreuth</td><td>Car</td><td>~40 min</td></tr><tr><td>Nuremberg</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h30</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.ochsenkopf.info/sommer/biking/">Seilbahnen Ochsenkopf</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
