  <Placemark>
    <name>Spiazzi di Gromo Bike Park (Val Seriana) [18 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Spiazzi di Gromo 1165 m - valley station of the Costa Gosa chairlift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Three downhill runs of different levels, technical and longer than the size of the place suggests, dropping from about 1700 m to 1200 m for roughly 500 m of vertical. A summer toboggan run, an adventure park and a parkour area share the base, so it works as a family day out rather than a pure gravity trip. The Val Seriana is an hour from Bergamo and largely ignored by anyone who is not local.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Costa Gosa and Vodala chairlifts from Spiazzi at 1165 m carry bikes. Day pass around 18 EUR.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open weekends from April to October and daily through July and August.<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Weekends only outside the July-August window; check the operator.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Bergamo</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h10</td></tr><tr><td>Milan</td><td>Car</td><td>~2h00</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.spiazzidigromo.it/estate.html">Spiazzi di Gromo</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
