  <Placemark>
    <name>Bike Park Rogla (Pohorje, Slovenia) [25 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Jurgovo 1070 m - valley station of the Jurgovo chairlift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Nine descents on the Pohorje plateau, six graded from blue to black plus two Super Flow lines - grades 5 and 6 in the park's own scale - loaded with jumps, drops and fast bends. Bridges and tabletops throughout. There is a dedicated skills circuit at the top for learning the basics, so the park genuinely works for a first day as well as for riders who want the Super Flows. Rental and guides on site.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Jurgovo chairlift from 1070 m and the Planja chairlift on the plateau. Day ticket 25 EUR.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from May; closed from mid-October (typical window; check the operator and conditions).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Zrece</td><td>Car</td><td>~30 min</td></tr><tr><td>Ljubljana</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h45</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.visitpohorje.si/en/price-lists/bike-park/">Visit Pohorje bike park</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
