  <Placemark>
    <name>Rocky Mountain Bikepark Samerberg (Bavaria) [22 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Grainbach 715 m - valley station of the Hochriesbahn chairlift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>One main freeride run rather than a set of separate lines: 2150 m and 220 m of drop, 44 corners from below the Hochriesbahn mid station down to the car park, with a blue line, single-trail variants, a table line and north-shore sections branching off it so you can build a different descent each lap. A pumptrack at the base. Small, well built, and close enough to Munich for an evening.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Hochriesbahn chairlift from Grainbach at 715 m to the mid station, with the cable car continuing to 1540 m. Note the park charges separately for trail use and for the lift: bike park day ticket 22 EUR adult, 15 EUR child, plus the lift ticket on top.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from May; closed from the end of October (typical window; check the operator and conditions).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Rosenheim</td><td>Car</td><td>~25 min</td></tr><tr><td>Munich</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h10</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.bikepark-samerberg.de/bikepark">Rocky Mountain Bikepark Samerberg</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
