  <Placemark>
    <name>LOTTO Thueringen Bikepark Oberhof (Thuringia) [25 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Oberhof 715 m - valley station of the Fallbach chairlift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Eleven lines on the Fallbach slope, running the full spread from an easy flow trail to a demanding downhill: flow, freeride, enduro and the Fallbach downhill track itself, with berms, tables and doubles throughout. A pumptrack and a big trick jump with a landing bag sit at the base, which is where you go to try the thing you are not ready for. Right on the Rennsteig, so the touring is there too.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Fallbach chairlift from 715 m. Day ticket 25 EUR adult, 18 EUR youth; half day 17 and 13 EUR; single ride 4 and 3 EUR.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from mid-April; closed from the end of October (typical window; check the operator and conditions).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Oberhof station</td><td>Bus</td><td>~15 min</td></tr><tr><td>Erfurt</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h00</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.thueringen.info/kultur/bikepark-oberhof/">Bikepark Oberhof</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
