  <Placemark>
    <name>BikeAlps Mariazell - Buergeralpe (Styria) [34 EUR, closure reported]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Mariazell 875 m - valley station of the Buergeralpe Express gondola</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/><b>Reported closed indefinitely</b> - confirm with the operator before travelling. When running, BikeAlps is a single-trail park on the Buergeralpe with up to four tracks, the two main ones graded S2 to S3: technical, natural ground, aimed at experienced riders rather than at anyone learning. There is no easy line here.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Buergeralpe Express gondola from Mariazell at 875 m to 1245 m in a few minutes. Day ticket 34 EUR adult, 22 EUR child; four-hour 28 and 18 EUR.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Reported closed indefinitely; the gondola itself continues to run in summer. Check the operator before planning a trip.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Mariazell centre</td><td>Walk</td><td>~5 min</td></tr><tr><td>Vienna</td><td>Car</td><td>~2h00</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.buergeralpe.at/sommer/preise/bike-tickets/">Mariazeller Buergeralpe</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
