  <Placemark>
    <name>Bike Park Lavarone - Alpe Cimbra (Trentino) [15 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Lavarone 1195 m - valley station of the Monte Tablat chairlift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Four runs on Monte Tablat, about 2 km each and named after cocktails: Rum Runner is the easy one, Mojito the medium, and Pina Colada and Whezzzy the two advanced lines. Small and unpretentious, on the Alpe Cimbra plateau where the riding is all forest rather than high alpine.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Monte Tablat chairlift from 1195 m. Lift about 15 EUR.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Weekends and holidays from 30 May, daily from 22 June to 6 September, then weekends again until 4 October.<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Published 2026 calendar; check the operator.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Trento</td><td>Car</td><td>~50 min</td></tr><tr><td>Verona</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h45</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.bikeparklavarone.it/index.php/tariffe-e-orari">Bikepark Lavarone</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
