  <Placemark>
    <name>Bikearena Aflenz - Buergeralm (Styria) [20 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Aflenz 870 m - valley station of the Buergeralm chairlift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Three trails and a lot of vertical for the price. The AB-Trail is the main event: 4 km and 600 m of descent, which is more than most parks this size offer. The Windgruben Trail adds 2 km and 300 m, and the short Pierergut Trail 1 km and 120 m. Natural Styrian ground rather than shaped berms.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Aflenz-Buergeralm double chairlift from 870 m to 1530 m. Day ticket 20 EUR adult, 15 EUR child; single ride 10 and 6 EUR; season 200 and 150 EUR.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from mid-May; closed from the end of October (operator's published window).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Bruck an der Mur</td><td>Car</td><td>~30 min</td></tr><tr><td>Graz</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h10</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.bikearena-aflenz.at/">Bikearena Aflenz</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
