    <name>Weissensee: top of the Bergbahn</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Weissensee Bergbahn 1335 m - top of the chairlift</b><br/><br/>Where the runs start. See the main Weissensee pin for trails, prices and access.]]></description>
