  <Placemark>
    <name>Bikepark Koenigsberg - Hollenstein an der Ybbs (Austria) [check operator]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Hollenstein an der Ybbs 700 m - valley station of the Koenigsberg lifts</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A compact, heavily built park on the Koenigsberg: a 2.5 km freeride trail carrying some 66 features, among them seven drops, tables and rollers, twenty wallrides, four north-shore sections and a logride over a 7 m gap; a 1 km downhill run left completely natural, on stone and roots; and a 2 km singletrail. Beginners and children get a 135 m technique trail and an 80 m pump track with 17 features. Showers, a workshop with rental, and the Gasthof Jagersberger sit at the base.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>A Doppelmayr drag lift, the first anywhere fitted with the then-new bike carrier bracket, plus a practice tow in the valley. Half-day tickets, 09:00-13:00 or 13:00-17:00, were 18 EUR adult, 15 EUR youth and 12 EUR child.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/><b>Check before you go: the company operating the Koenigsberg lifts filed for insolvency at the end of 2025</b> - a 452,500 EUR loss after a 2024/25 winter with three days of lift operation - and the first creditors' meeting was held in January 2026. The park's own site, koenigsberg.at, is no longer live. Whether the bike park runs in a given summer now depends on the outcome of that process, so confirm with the municipality before travelling.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Waidhofen an der Ybbs</td><td>Car</td><td>~30 min</td></tr><tr><td>Vienna</td><td>Car</td><td>~2h00</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://noe.orf.at/stories/3328421/">ORF Niederoesterreich on the insolvency</a>, <a href="https://www.ride-mtb.com/en/news/the-bike-park-trap">Ride MTB</a>, <a href="https://hollenstein-ybbs.gv.at/">Hollenstein an der Ybbs</a> and <a href="https://www.bikeparks.at/bikeparks/bikeparks-niederoesterreich/bikepark-koenigsberg-hollenstein.html">bikeparks.at</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
