  <Placemark>
    <name>KitzBike - Kitzbuehel Flow Trails (Tyrol) [44 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Kitzbuehel 775 m - valley station of the Hahnenkammbahn</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Long descents rather than a shaped park, on the mountain everyone knows from the Hahnenkamm downhill. The Hahnenkamm Trail runs 7.2 km and drops 850 m from the top of the Hahnenkammbahn straight back into Kitzbuehel, with helmet and protectors required for its whole length. The Fleckalm Trail is one of the five official Great Trails Tirol and gives over 1000 m of vertical of real enduro riding. Newer for 2026 is the Kirchberg Trail, linking the top of the Fleckalmbahn into the existing Gaisberg network, and the Sonnenrast Trail is the easy S1 option with short S2 sections.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Four lifts serve the trails: the Hahnenkammbahn and Fleckalmbahn cable cars and the Sonnenrast and Gaisberg chairlifts. A downhill-trails day ticket (Lisi Osl and Gaisberg) is 44 EUR adult, 33 EUR youth, 22 EUR child; the Kitz Trail Card, covering the wider lift set, is 59 EUR adult. Two-, three- and flexible four-in-seven tickets run 103 to 167.50 EUR. Guest-card holders pay about 2 EUR less per day.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>The flow trails open 6 June 2026 and run through the summer lift season.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Kitzbuehel station</td><td>Walk</td><td>~15 min</td></tr><tr><td>Innsbruck</td><td>Train</td><td>~1h30</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.kitzski.at/en/hiking-biking/kitzbike-trails.html">KitzSki KitzBike trails</a>, <a href="https://www.kitzski.at/en/tickets-vouchers/bike-tickets.html">KitzSki bike tickets</a>, <a href="https://www.kitzbuehel.com/sport/biken/single-trails/">Kitzbuehel tourism single trails</a> and <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/">OpenStreetMap</a> (ODbL) for the trail geometry. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
