  <Placemark>
    <name>Monte Pora - Cima Pora (Val Seriana, Lombardy) [check operator]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Monte Pora 1460 m - valley station of the Cima Pora chairlift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Be clear about what is here: Monte Pora runs a summer chairlift and rents mountain and e-bikes, but its own site advertises no marked downhill park, and the skill park at the top is a wooden balance and adventure course rather than an MTB feature line. What you get is a 1370-1880 m ski mountain in the Orobie with the Cima Pora descent and the forest roads and paths around it, ridden as natural terrain. Good for a relaxed lift-assisted day, not for a bike-park session.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Termen chairlift, daily 09:30-16:30 in summer, sold through the resort's own ticket shop; there is no published bike-specific rate. MTB and e-bike rental on site. Phone 0346 65000 for lift information.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Summer, with the chairlift and rental running daily and the skill park 10:30-16:00.<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:30-16:30<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Castione della Presolana</td><td>Car</td><td>~20 min</td></tr><tr><td>Bergamo</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h20</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.montepora.com/">Monte Pora</a> and <a href="https://www.montepora.com/pista/pista-raccordo-cima-pora/">Monte Pora - Cima Pora</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
