  <Placemark>
    <name>Sappee Bikepark (Palkane, Finland) [42 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Sappee 125 m - valley station of the Sappee drag lifts</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Finland's busiest downhill centre, and it was voted the country's bike park of the year in 2021. Twenty trails on 125 m of hill, which sounds small until you see how densely they are packed: Icebreaker, Firestarter, Fresh Cut and Eastway among the built lines, Lemminkainen, Double Trouble and Safari at the harder end, and a plain DH track. A Trainee Zone with its own conveyor belt holds three easy tracks - Drifter, Jumper and Bumpy Ride - for children and first-timers. Coaching and rental on site.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Ski lifts carry riders and bikes. Day ticket 42 EUR adult, 33 EUR for under-12s and seniors; two hours 40 and 31 EUR; season pass 310 EUR. An Axess smart card is 8 EUR extra and required. A full package - lift, bike, body armour, knee pads, full-face and goggles - is 119.90 EUR, or 65 EUR booked a week ahead for a Friday. On Super Tuesdays a three-hour lift ticket drops to 15 EUR, or 55-60 EUR with all the kit.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>The Finnish summer season, from June.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Tampere</td><td>Car</td><td>~50 min</td></tr><tr><td>Helsinki</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h45</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.sappee.fi/en/sappee-bike-park/">Sappee Bike Park</a>, <a href="https://www.sappee.fi/en/bike-park-pricelist/">Sappee Bike Park price list</a> and <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/">OpenStreetMap</a> (ODbL) for the trail names and geometry. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
