  <Placemark>
    <name>Sport Areal Kliny (Krusne hory, Czech Republic) [680 CZK]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Kliny 595 m - valley station of the Kliny chairlift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Three trails leave the top of the chairlift and branch into a network of blue, red and black lines - singletrack, downhill, forest ground, built obstacles and jumps. Green and blue are aimed at beginners and families, red at experienced riders and black at riders who know what they are doing. Mapped lines include the 4.3 km Hamr trail, the Deer trail and the Ethylen trail. Downhill and enduro bikes and off-road scooters rent on site; free parking at the Hotel Emeran with a restaurant and terrace bar.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>A four-seat chairlift takes riders and bikes; ordinary bikes travel free with a ticket but e-bikes are not carried. Day pass 680 CZK adult, 490 CZK child (7-15); a single ride 100 and 80 CZK; season pass 6900 and 4900 CZK.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>May to October. Daily 10:00-18:00 in July and August; Friday to Sunday only in May, June, September and October.<br/>Daily opening hours: 10:00-18:00<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Most</td><td>Car</td><td>~30 min</td></tr><tr><td>Dresden</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h30</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://kliny.cz/en/bike-park-eng/">Sport areal Kliny bike park</a>, <a href="https://www.krusnehory.cz/en/sport-and-relaxation/sport-area-kliny-9774.html">Krusne hory tourism</a> and <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/">OpenStreetMap</a> (ODbL) for the trail names and geometry. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
