  <Placemark>
    <name>Bikearena Silbersattel - Steinach (Thuringia) [28 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Steinach 700 m - valley station of the Silbersattel chairlift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Rebuilt from scratch. Thueringen Alpin GmbH, which ran the hill, went insolvent in 2024; the town of Steinach took the mountain over and reopened it as the Erlebnis- und Aktivpark Silbersattel, and the bike season restarts on 11 July 2026 behind a brand-new Doppelmayr six-seat chairlift built in 2025. Three completely new trails, about 4 km together and roughly 250 m of descent per lap: an easy Flowtrail of 1440 m for beginners, a 610 m Jumpline for airtime, and a hard 1200 m Downhill. The older arena counted four main trails and a spread of variants over about 8 km. Mountaincarts rent alongside the bikes.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The new six-seat chairlift, with bike carriers. From the 2024 summer tariff: day pass 28 EUR adult, 25 EUR reduced, 19 EUR child; a single up and down 8 EUR adult, 6 EUR reduced; season pass 280, 240 and 190 EUR. Confirm against the new operator's list.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>From 11 July 2026. Friday 12:00-20:00, Saturday 10:00-18:00, Sunday 10:00-17:00.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Sonneberg</td><td>Car</td><td>~25 min</td></tr><tr><td>Nuremberg</td><td>Car</td><td>~2h00</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.silbersattel.de/index.php">Ski und Bikearena Steinach</a>, <a href="https://www.bikepark-online.de/bikeparks/deutschland/rennsteig-bikearena-steinach/">Bikepark-Online on the rebuild</a> and <a href="https://www.thueringen.info/kultur/bikearena-silbersattel/">Thueringen tourism</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
