  <Placemark>
    <name>Golte (Savinja valley, Slovenia) [check operator]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Zekovec 495 m - valley station of the Golte cable car</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A small Bike & Fun Park laid out on part of the Medvedjak ski slope and the family trail beside it. When it opened only the black downhill run was rideable, with a circular route planned round the Medvedjak summit past the reservoir to link the existing Rocka, Stari Stan and Beli Zajec paths back to the alpine garden. Golte is included in the Bike Slovenia Summer Pass, the single pass covering Slovenian bike parks.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Two stages: the 56-person gondola from Zekovec climbs to the Medvedjak plateau at about 1410 m in eight minutes, running every 30 minutes, then the three-seat Medvedjak chairlift reaches the top of the park. Published fares - 18 EUR for a day of unlimited chairlift and gondola, 15 EUR for one chairlift plus the gondola, 3 EUR for a single chairlift ride - date from the park's opening season and should be treated as indicative.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Summer, roughly July to late August.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Mozirje</td><td>Car</td><td>~20 min</td></tr><tr><td>Ljubljana</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h15</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.mtb.si/novice/bike-fun-park-golte-od-9-julija/">mtb.si on the park opening</a> and <a href="https://www.slovenia.info/en/things-to-do/active-holidays/biking/bike-parks">Slovenian tourist board bike parks</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
