  <Placemark>
    <name>Funbase Holzmeisterlift (Styria) [34 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Pirstingerkogel 1290 m - valley station of the Holzmeister t-bar</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A family-first park on the Sommeralm in the Almenland, relaunched on 22 May 2026 under a year-round concept. Five mountain-bike trails of different grades - a flowline, singletrails, a dedicated children's trail and a marked uphill - plus a new mountaincart track sharing the lift. Biking Fuerst runs the on-site school: skills coaching, MTB and e-MTB courses, guided rides and bike camps for children.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>A drag lift adapted for bikes. With the lift: day 34 EUR adult, 24 EUR child; two hours 26 and 18 EUR; a single ride 13 and 10 EUR. Riding the trails without the lift is 24 EUR a day adult, 16 EUR child. Rates include the 10 percent transport tax.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>22 May to late October. Wednesday to Sunday in June, daily from July to early September, then Wednesday to Sunday again.<br/>Daily opening hours: 10:00-17:00<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Bruck an der Mur</td><td>Car</td><td>~35 min</td></tr><tr><td>Graz</td><td>Car</td><td>~50 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://funbase-holzmeisterlift.at/preise-sommer/">Funbase Holzmeisterlift prices</a> and <a href="https://www.almenland.at/erlebnisparks/funbaseholzmeisterlift/">Almenland tourism</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
