  <Placemark>
    <name>Bikepark Jested (Liberec, Czech Republic) [450 CZK]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Horni Hanychov 542 m - valley station of the Skalka chairlift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>The classic Czech downhill hill, on the Liberec side of Jested. A handful of marked lines - at least 2 green, alongside the steep, rooty race tracks the mountain is known for - with roughly 340 m of lift-served vertical from the Skalka chair, more if you ride from the summit. Technical and wet-weather-sensitive rather than groomed flow.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Skalka chairlift from Horni Hanychov to about 881 m; the Jested cable car serves the summit. Around 450 CZK for a day.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Roughly May to mid-October.<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Estimated; not yet checked against the operator.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Liberec centre</td><td>Tram + bus</td><td>~25 min</td></tr><tr><td>Prague</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h15</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://skijested.cz/">Skiareal Jested</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
