  <Placemark>
    <name>Bike Park Donovaly (Low Tatras, Slovakia) [15 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Donovaly 913 m - valley station of the Telemix Nova hola</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Around 8 marked runs on Nova hola, with at least 2 blue and 3 black - a genuinely gravity-leaning spread for a Slovak pass resort. Roughly 435 m of lift-served vertical on open ridge slopes above the Donovaly saddle.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Telemix Nova hola, a combined chair-and-gondola lift, from 913 m to about 1349 m. Around 15 EUR for a day.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Roughly June to the end of September.<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-16:30<br/><small>Estimated; not yet checked against the operator.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Banska Bystrica</td><td>Car</td><td>~30 min</td></tr><tr><td>Bratislava</td><td>Car</td><td>~2h45</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.donovaly.sk/">Obec Donovaly</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
