  <Placemark>
    <name>Bike Park Bachledova Dolina (Zdiar, Slovakia) [17 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Bachledova dolina 884 m - valley station of the Bachledka gondola</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Four downhill trails under the Belianske Tatras, signed green through black with pictograms at every junction, plus a pump track that was the first of its kind in the Tatras. The park has been running since 2010, and the mapped New Air DH line is the one that gives the area its reputation. Rental and a bike wash at the base.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>A chairlift carries riders and bikes. A return chairlift ticket is around 17 EUR for an adult, with slight seasonal variation.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>From 1 June. Weekends 09:00-16:00, and daily 09:00-16:00 through the summer holidays.<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-16:00<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Poprad</td><td>Car</td><td>~45 min</td></tr><tr><td>Zakopane</td><td>Car</td><td>~40 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.bachledka.sk/">Bachledka Ski and Sun</a>, <a href="https://www.zdiar.eu/sk/info/18-aktivity/41-bike-park-bachledova.html">Zdiar tourism</a> and <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/">OpenStreetMap</a> (ODbL) for the trail geometry. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
