  <Placemark>
    <name>Gravity Park Kotelnica (Bialka Tatrzanska, Poland) [120 PLN]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Bialka Tatrzanska 702 m - valley station of the Kotelnica Express</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Five one-way trails under the Tatras at Bialka Tatrzanska. Family Monster is the green one - wide, gentle, safe corners and no jumps at all. Flow and Jump is the blue, and carries a separate beginner line so you can learn to jump and to ride a berm on shaped ground. Lasica, Lisica and Kolster are the reds: profiled berms, hops and natural obstacles for riders chasing speed. Two bike wash stations on site.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>A chairlift takes riders and bikes up. <b>E-bikes are not carried</b> - if you are on one you pedal to the start.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>The summer season at the Kotelnica Bialczanska ski centre.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Zakopane</td><td>Car</td><td>~25 min</td></tr><tr><td>Krakow</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h45</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://bialkatatrzanska.pl/lato-w-bialce/gravity-park">Gravity Park Kotelnica Bialczanska</a> and <a href="https://bialkatatrzanska.pl/en/summer/gravity-park/">Kotelnica Bialczanska (English)</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
