  <Placemark>
    <name>PKL Bike Park Palenica (Szczawnica, Poland) [69 PLN]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Szczawnica 451 m - valley station of the Palenica chairlift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Two downhill lines off the Palenica chairlift above Szczawnica: Rozbojnik, 1700 m and rideable by a competent intermediate as well as by downhill regulars, and Ciupadze, 1150 m and aimed squarely at advanced and racing riders. Together with Gora Zar and Mosorny Gron the PKL group runs over 35 km of graded trail.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Palenica chairlift. One PKL bike pass is valid at Mosorny Gron, Gora Zar, Palenica and Butorowy Wierch and includes third-party and accident cover; day passes fall to 69 PLN from September to the season's end, and a ten-ride card is available.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Roughly May to the end of October.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Nowy Targ</td><td>Car</td><td>~40 min</td></tr><tr><td>Krakow</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h45</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.pkl.pl/palenica/trasy-rowerowe.html">PKL Palenica trails</a> and <a href="https://www.pkl.pl/palenica/trasy-rowerowe-palenica.html">PKL Palenica bike passes</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
