  <Placemark>
    <name>Koninki Gravity Park (Gorce, Poland) [80 PLN]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Koninki 655 m - valley station of the Tobolow chairlift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Four trails on Tobolow in the Gorce, covering beginner ground through to genuinely advanced, with jumps, berms and technical sections built in. One of the older Polish gravity parks - the bike season here was inaugurated in 2011.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Tobolow chairlift: 1450 m long, 309 m of climb to a 994 m summit, about ten minutes. The operator quotes bike-pass prices on request rather than publishing a table.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Summer season.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Rabka-Zdroj</td><td>Car</td><td>~30 min</td></tr><tr><td>Krakow</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h15</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="http://koninki24.pl/strona-glowna/koninki-gravity-park.html">Koninki Gravity Park</a> and <a href="http://ostojakoninki.pl/cennik/">Ostoja Koninki price list</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
