  <Placemark>
    <name>Straja Bike Park (Lupeni, Romania) [30 RON]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Lupeni 752 m - valley station of the Straja gondola</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>About 8 marked runs above the mining town of Lupeni, at least 1 green and 5 blue. The gondola alone gives close to 600 m of vertical, and a further set of chairlifts continues to about 1700 m on the Straja plateau, so the descents here are long by Romanian standards.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Straja gondola from 752 m to about 1345 m, with the Baloo and Constantinescu chairs continuing higher. Around 30 RON for a day.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Roughly June to the end of September.<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Estimated; not yet checked against the operator.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Petrosani</td><td>Car</td><td>~25 min</td></tr><tr><td>Sibiu</td><td>Car</td><td>~2h30</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://straja.ro/">Straja</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
