  <Placemark>
    <name>Arena Platos Bike Park (Paltinis, Romania) [54 RON]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Arena Platos 1307 m - valley station of the Platos chairlift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Five graded lines a few kilometres from Paltinis, and the resort pitches itself as Austrian build quality at Romanian prices. The blue Family Track is about 1000 m, wide and moderately pitched for beginners and families. The yellow Flow Track runs 500 m for beginners moving up. The orange Funny Track, about 400 m, adds obstacles for intermediate and advanced riders, and a red track of roughly 600 m completes the set.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The chairlift carries bikes to the start of the downhill routes.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Summer season at the Arena Platos resort.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Sibiu</td><td>Car</td><td>~45 min</td></tr><tr><td>Brasov</td><td>Car</td><td>~3h00</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://paltinisarena.ro/vara/activitati/downhill-trails.html">Paltinis Arena downhill trails</a> and <a href="https://paltinisarena.ro/vara/activitati/telescaun.html">Paltinis Arena chairlift</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
