  <Placemark>
    <name>Tahko Bike Park (Nilsia, Finland) [15 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Tahkovuori 100 m - valley station of chairlift 7</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>About 13 marked runs on Tahkovuori above lake Syvari, with at least 2 green, 4 blue and 3 black - one of the better-balanced Finnish parks. Vertical is only around 180 m, but the hill is steep for Finland and the trails are built rather than eroded.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Chairlift 7 from about 100 m to 281 m, with a second chair and several drag lifts on the hill. Around 15 EUR for a day.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Roughly June to the end of September.<br/>Daily opening hours: 10:00-18:00<br/><small>Estimated; not yet checked against the operator.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Kuopio</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h00</td></tr><tr><td>Helsinki</td><td>Car</td><td>~4h30</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.tahko.com/">Tahko</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
