  <Placemark>
    <name>Tjorhomfjellet Bike Park (Sirdal, Norway) [check operator]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Tjorhom 609 m - valley station of the Trollekspressen</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A small park in Sirdal with roughly 310 m of lift-served vertical on bare fjell terrain. The directory carries no trail count for it, so the number of marked runs is unknown - treat this as a lift and a mountain rather than a documented trail network until it is checked.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Trollekspressen chairlift from 609 m to about 918 m, with the Alsheia drags on the neighbouring slope. Check the operator for the summer bike ticket.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Roughly mid-June to mid-September.<br/>Daily opening hours: 10:00-16:00<br/><small>Estimated; not yet checked against the operator.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Stavanger</td><td>Car</td><td>~2h00</td></tr><tr><td>Kristiansand</td><td>Car</td><td>~2h15</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="http://www.sirdal-skisenter.no/">Sirdal Skisenter</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
