    </ExtendedData>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Bike Park Nowa Osada (Wisla, Poland) [100 PLN]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Wisla 485 m - valley station of the Nowa Osada chairlift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Three trails on the Nowa Osada hill at Wisla, and the easiest is also the longest - a 2.5 km blue flowtrail. The red keeps the flow character but adds bigger tables, step-ups and step-downs, and a Pink Line is being built with six large tables, two step-downs and a shark. A quieter alternative to the busier Beskid parks.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>A four-seat cable car. All-day bike ticket 100 PLN, 90 PLN reduced; a single ride 35 PLN, 25 PLN reduced; a return 30 PLN; four-hour tickets also sold.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Thursday to Sunday, 10:00-18:00.<br/>Daily opening hours: 10:00-18:00<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Bielsko-Biala</td><td>Car</td><td>~50 min</td></tr><tr><td>Katowice</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h20</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://nowaosada.pl/o-bike-parku/">Bike Park Nowa Osada</a> and <a href="https://nowaosada.pl/cennik-lato/">Nowa Osada summer price list</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
