  <Placemark>
    <name>Gorny Vozdukh Bike Park (Yuzhno-Sakhalinsk, Russia) [840 RUB]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Yuzhno-Sakhalinsk 102 m - valley station of the gondola</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A resort inside the city - the base is 500 m from Victory Square in Yuzhno-Sakhalinsk - spread over Mount Bolshevik and Mount Krasnaya. Summer riding uses the ski terrain and the lift network rather than a separately graded bike park, so expect ski-slope descents and service roads rather than shaped lines.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Five lifts on Bolshevik, gondola, chairlift and drag, plus one chairlift on Krasnaya. Published fares run from about 170 RUB for a single ride to 1100 RUB for five hours. Service centre, rental, lockers, parking and a cafe at the base.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>The warm season; the winter season here runs December to late April.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Yuzhno-Sakhalinsk centre</td><td>Car</td><td>~10 min</td></tr><tr><td>Yuzhno-Sakhalinsk airport</td><td>Car</td><td>~20 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://ski-gv.ru/hills/">Gorny Vozdukh - slopes and lifts</a> and <a href="https://ski-gv.ru/about-us/tarif/">Gorny Vozdukh tariffs</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
