  <Placemark>
    <name>Bannoye Bike Park (Bashkortostan, Russia) [1200 RUB]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Bannoye 496 m - valley station of the gondola</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Two marked mountain-bike trails from the top of the lift at about 920 m on the Yamankay ridge, dropping through Ural forest, and the hill has hosted downhill competition - so the terrain is better than the trail count suggests. A rope park and the Yamankay adventure park share the summer site, and bikes rent at the base.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>An Austrian eight-person gondola, 1650 m long with up to 450 m of vertical, taking about ten minutes in summer.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>The warm season, once the summit trail opens.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Magnitogorsk</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h00</td></tr><tr><td>Ufa</td><td>Car</td><td>~5h30</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://na-bannoe.ru/gls-bannoe-metallurg-magnitigorsk/">Bannoye ski centre</a> and <a href="https://www.kp.ru/russia/abzakovo/mesta/kanatnye-dorogi/">Cable cars at Abzakovo and Bannoye</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
