  <Placemark>
    <name>Manzherok Bike Park (Altai, Russia) [1000 RUB]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Manzherok 377 m - valley station of the Chuysky Trakt gondola</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>The resort claims the largest bike park in Russia: over 13 km of trail on the slopes above Lake Manzherok in the Altai, including a black line billed as the hardest grade they build. Eco-trails through the Guardian of the Greater Altai park share the mountain in summer.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>A large lift system - six gondolas and four chairlifts, among them the Legend 390 gondola running out over the lake - with free parking at the base. Summer bike tariffs are sold through the resort's own ticketing.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Summer, alongside the resort's warm-season programme.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Gorno-Altaysk</td><td>Car</td><td>~40 min</td></tr><tr><td>Barnaul</td><td>Car</td><td>~4h00</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://xn--80akcrghjp.xn--p1ai/mountains/cableways">Manzherok resort cableways</a> and <a href="https://xn--80akcrghjp.xn--p1ai/walking-tickets">Manzherok summer tickets</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
