  <Placemark>
    <name>Laajis Bikepark (Jyvaskyla, Finland) [25 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Laajavuori 147 m - valley station of the Ankkuri drag lift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>About 12 marked runs at Laajavuori on the edge of Jyvaskyla, with at least 1 green and 10 blue - very much a flow and progression park. Uplift is by drag lift rather than chair, on roughly 85 m of vertical.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Ankkuri drag lifts from about 147 m to 230 m, with the Takarin lift on the far side. Around 25 EUR for a day.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>The directory gives a 27 May start; roughly late May to the end of September.<br/>Daily opening hours: 12:00-20:00<br/><small>Season start from the directory listing; hours estimated.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Jyvaskyla centre</td><td>Car</td><td>~10 min</td></tr><tr><td>Helsinki</td><td>Car</td><td>~3h15</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://laajis.fi/">Laajis</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
