  <Placemark>
    <name>Ski Bike Hike Ulricehamn (Sweden) [340 SEK]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Ulricehamn 185 m - valley station of the Vist drag lift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Twelve trails and a beginner area on 140 m of vertical just north of Ulricehamn. Three are machine-built - a green, a blue and a red jumpline - and the other nine are natural: one blue, four red and three black. Over 120 open days a summer, which is a lot for southern Sweden. The Dalstugan restaurant and a warming cabin with food are on site, along with bike, full-face and back-protector rental.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Seven drag lifts serve the hill in winter; the bike operation uses them through the summer.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Summer, with over 120 operating days.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Boras</td><td>Car</td><td>~40 min</td></tr><tr><td>Gothenburg</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h30</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://skibikehike.se/en/">Ski Bike Hike Ulricehamn</a> and <a href="https://www.vastsverige.com/en/ulricehamn/produkter/ski-bike-hike/">West Sweden tourism</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
