  <Placemark>
    <name>Uuperi Bike Park (Hamina, Finland) [20 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Hamina 34 m - valley station of the drag lift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>About 8 marked runs on a very small coastal hill in south-east Finland, with a surprisingly steep spread for the size - at least 3 green, 1 blue and 2 black. The mapped drag lifts cover only about 20 m of measured vertical; on hills this low the elevation model is coarse, so treat the figure as approximate.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Drag lifts from about 34 m to 55 m. Around 20 EUR for a day.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>The directory gives a 10 June start; roughly June to the end of September.<br/>Daily opening hours: 12:00-20:00<br/><small>Season start from the directory listing; hours estimated.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Hamina</td><td>Car</td><td>~10 min</td></tr><tr><td>Helsinki</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h45</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://uuperi.fi/">Uuperi</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
