  <Placemark>
    <name>Kalpalinna Bike Park (Janakkala, Finland) [check operator]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Janakkala 108 m - valley station of the drag lifts</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Around 7 marked runs, at least 3 blue, on a small hill between Helsinki and Tampere. Six short drag lifts serve the slope; the measured vertical is only about 15 m, which is low even for southern Finland and suggests the elevation model is not resolving the hill well - check the real drop with the operator.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Drag lifts from about 108 m to 120 m. The directory lists no price. Check the operator.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Roughly mid-May to the end of September.<br/>Daily opening hours: 12:00-20:00<br/><small>Estimated; not yet checked against the operator.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Hameenlinna</td><td>Car</td><td>~20 min</td></tr><tr><td>Helsinki</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h15</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://kalpalinna.fi/">Kalpalinna</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
