  <Placemark>
    <name>Bike Park Gruniky (Namestovo, Slovakia) [10 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Gruniky 674 m - valley station of the drag lift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Eight graded downhill trails cut through dense Orava forest at Sihelne, about 15 km from Namestovo, and rated among the better parks in Slovakia. The grading is broad enough that recreational riders have somewhere to go as well as the adrenaline end.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Three lifts - one of 400 m and two of 1000 m - carry riders and bikes, and the descents start from the top station.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Summer season at the Ski Gruniky centre.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Namestovo</td><td>Car</td><td>~15 min</td></tr><tr><td>Zilina</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h15</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.ski-gruniky.sk/">Ski Gruniky</a> and <a href="https://namestovo.info/bike-park-gruniky/">Namestovo Info</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
