  <Placemark>
    <name>Bike Park Kurza Gora (Kurzetnik, Poland) [79 PLN]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Kurzetnik 97 m - valley station of the drag lift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>The only bike park in northern Poland, on the hill under the observation tower at Kurzetnik in Masuria, and the newest in the Penguin group. Three built trails - green, blue and red - with a lot of berms, jumps and tabletops, so it is a place to work on jumping technique rather than to find raw vertical. Rental from name brands, a tool bar, a bike wash, a restaurant, year-round tubing and a children's playground on site.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The ski lift carries riders and bikes; the park publishes its bike tariff on its price-list pages.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>The summer season.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Olsztyn</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h00</td></tr><tr><td>Warsaw</td><td>Car</td><td>~2h45</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://kurzagora.pl/en/bike-park/">Kurza Gora Ski and Bike Park</a> and <a href="https://kurzagora.pl/oferta/">Kurza Gora - oferta</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
