  <Placemark>
    <name>Lago-Naki Bike Park - Dakhovskaya (Adygea, Russia) [1200 RUB]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Dakhovskaya 455 m - valley station of the Savranskaya cable car</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Green, blue, red and black lines with jumps and steep turns on the Una-Koz ridge above Dakhovskaya, built by the instructors who coach here - competitive riders who cut the trails themselves. Downhill coaching is part of the offer, with sessions bundling an instructor, bike, full protection and the lift pass.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Savranskaya cable car carries riders and bikes; bike passes are sold at the base. The cable car itself is about 1200 RUB adult and 600 RUB for children 6-12, under-6s free.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Daily 09:00-18:00.<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-18:00<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Maykop</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h15</td></tr><tr><td>Krasnodar</td><td>Car</td><td>~3h30</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://newgesh.ru/bikepark">Lago-Naki bike park</a> and <a href="http://armola.ru/gory/5/dahovskaja-kanatnaja-doroga.html">Savranskaya cable car, Dakhovskaya</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
