  <Placemark>
    <name>Bikepark Koliba (Bratislava, Slovakia) [9 EUR / 3 rides]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Zelezna studnicka 254 m - valley station of the Kamzik chairlift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Three trails on the Kamzik hillside above Bratislava, between Zelezna Studnicka and the summit, and close enough to the city to be an after-work lap. Rohatka is the downhill and freeride line, Driver 8 the second freeride run, and the Blue Trail is the easy one - berms, banked turns and doubles built for riders starting out.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Kamzik chairlift, about fifteen minutes to the top, running Tuesday to Sunday in summer. Nine euros buys three rides. <b>The trails themselves are free</b> - you are only paying for the lift.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Summer season.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Bratislava centre</td><td>Bus</td><td>~20 min</td></tr><tr><td>Vienna</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h15</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://bikeparkkoliba.sk/?lang=en">Bikepark Koliba</a> and <a href="https://bratislavaregion.travel/poi/5346/bikepark-koliba">Bratislava Region tourism</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
