  <Placemark>
    <name>Kesberget Bikepark (Vargarda, Sweden) [180 SEK]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Vargarda 112 m - valley station of the drag lift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Around 12 marked runs on a small hill in Vastergotland, at least 1 green and 1 blue. Roughly 45 m of drag-served vertical - short laps on a local club hill between Gothenburg and Boras.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>A drag lift from 112 m to about 157 m. Around 180 SEK for a day.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Roughly May to the end of September.<br/>Daily opening hours: 16:00-21:00<br/><small>Estimated; not yet checked against the operator.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Boras</td><td>Car</td><td>~30 min</td></tr><tr><td>Gothenburg</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h00</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://kesbergetbikepark.wordpress.com/">Kesberget Bikepark</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
