  <Placemark>
    <name>Bike Park de la Mouliere - Caille (Alpes-Maritimes) [13 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>La Mouliere 1011 m - bottom of the runs above Escragnolles</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>The first bike park in the Maritime Alps, and still the one nearest the coast, which gives it the longest season in the region. Fourteen marked MTB routes off the chairlift on the Audibergue side above Caille - six downhill lines and two touring routes among them - averaging about 1.5 km with 200 to 220 m of drop each. Short laps, dry southern ground.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>A chairlift. Day pass 13 EUR adult, 11 EUR under-12; half day 11 and 8 EUR; a single lift 6 and 5 EUR; two days 24 and 19 EUR.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Weekends, public holidays and long weekends in May, June and September; daily in July and August.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Grasse</td><td>Car</td><td>~35 min</td></tr><tr><td>Nice</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h15</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://ville-caille.com/espace-tourisme/loisirs-et-activites/bike-park-location-vtt/">Mairie de Caille - Bike Park</a> and <a href="https://www.paysdegrassetourisme.fr/bike-park-de-la-mouliere-5904579/">Pays de Grasse tourism</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-brown</styleUrl>
