  <Placemark>
    <name>Robidisce Trail Center (Slovenia) [36 EUR shuttle]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Robidisce 681 m - trail centre above the Nadiza valley</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Five hand-built, maintained trails and a skills park at Slovenia's westernmost village, in the Breginj corner above the Nadiza - which the locals will tell you is the warmest alpine river in Europe, and the trails finish just above it. The centre won a national Snovalec award for the way it was put together.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/><b>No lift.</b> Two vans shuttle riders to the trailheads; the vinjeta is 36 EUR a person for a full day of unlimited runs.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Shuttles Saturday and Sunday 10:00-18:00, or 09:00-17:00 in September and October, and midweek by arrangement. Confirm before travelling.<br/>Daily opening hours: 10:00-18:00<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Kobarid</td><td>Car</td><td>~30 min</td></tr><tr><td>Udine</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h15</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://bikegalaxy.si/ready-to-ride/robidisce-trails-shuttle-day">Robidisce trails shuttle day</a> and <a href="https://alliancease.com/projects/trail-center-robidisce/">Alliance, who built the trail centre</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
