  <Placemark>
    <name>4 Riders Bike Park (Berga, Catalonia) [30 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Berga 638 m - bottom of the runs below the Figuerassa</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>About 8 marked runs at the foot of the Pre-Pyrenees, at least 2 green and 1 blue. OpenStreetMap tags the site 4 Riders Bike Park and carries a graded network above it reaching about 1420 m on the Figuerassa ridge, so the available descent is close to 800 m.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No lift. Uplift is by shuttle, around 30 EUR for a day.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Roughly March to the end of November.<br/>Daily opening hours: daylight hours<br/><small>Estimated; not yet checked against the operator.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Berga</td><td>Car</td><td>~10 min</td></tr><tr><td>Barcelona</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h30</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://4ridersbikepark.com/">4Riders Bike Park</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
