  <Placemark>
    <name>Bikepark Trippstadt (Palatinate, Germany) [no lift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Trippstadt 417 m - the bike park in the Pfalzerwald</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Only 2 marked runs, both blue, but the park sits inside the MTB-Park Pfalzerwald, one of Germany's largest waymarked mountain-bike networks - OpenStreetMap carries over 120 graded ways within a few kilometres. Come for the surrounding network as much as the park.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No lift. Everything here is pedalled; the directory lists no price, and the park itself is free to ride.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Roughly mid-March to mid-November - low, sheltered sandstone forest that drains well.<br/>Daily opening hours: daylight hours<br/><small>Estimated; not yet checked against the operator.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Kaiserslautern</td><td>Car</td><td>~20 min</td></tr><tr><td>Mannheim</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h00</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.bikepark-trippstadt.de/">Bikepark Trippstadt</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
