  <Placemark>
    <name>DAV Bikepark Skillup - Augsburg (Germany) [free for DAV members]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Augsburg 499 m - the DAV Skillup bike park</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Not a descent but a training ground, and an unusually good one: 7500 m2 in the Goeggingen district of Augsburg, opened by the Alpine Club's Augsburg section in May 2026. Areas for balance and bike handling, jump and cornering technique, and set pieces that recreate the riding situations you meet in the Alps - so it is aimed at riders preparing for mountain terrain as much as at beginners.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/><b>No lift</b> - it is a skills area. DAV Augsburg members ride free; non-members pay an entry fee.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Through the riding season.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Augsburg centre</td><td>Car</td><td>~15 min</td></tr><tr><td>Munich</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h00</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.skillup-augsburg.de/">Skillup Augsburg</a> and <a href="https://www.dav-augsburg.de/Abteilungen/Mountainbike">DAV Augsburg mountain bike section</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
