    <name>Ober Mountain: top of the aerial tramway</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Ober Mountain 812 m - top of the tramway</b><br/><br/>The resort itself, and where the descents start; three further chairs reach about 1050 m. See the main Ober Mountain pin for trails, prices and access.]]></description>
