  <Placemark>
    <name>Hidden Vale Adventure Park (Queensland, Australia) [20 AUD]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Grandchester 137 m - Hidden Vale Adventure Park</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Eighty to a hundred kilometres of trail on a 12,000-acre property an hour west of Brisbane, shared with runners and walkers. The ground varies from smooth groomed fire trail to big rocky outcrops, and the network is built wide enough to suit cross-country riders and downhillers on the same day.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/><b>No lift.</b> Day pass 20 AUD a rider, with the money going into trail development; it includes a trail map and the bike wash bay. The HVAP High 5 shuttle runs Saturdays and Sundays at 60 AUD a rider including the day pass. Bike hire is 150 AUD a day with a loan helmet.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Year round.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Ipswich</td><td>Car</td><td>~30 min</td></tr><tr><td>Brisbane</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h15</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://hiddenvaleadventurepark.com.au/">Hidden Vale Adventure Park</a> and <a href="https://hiddenvaleadventurepark.com.au/hire-uplifts/">Hidden Vale hire and uplifts</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
