  <Placemark>
    <name>Bollekollen Bike Park (Bollebygd, Sweden) [270 SEK]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Bollebygd 118 m - the Bollekollen hill</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>About 7 marked runs, at least 2 green and 2 blue, on a small ski hill between Gothenburg and Boras. OpenStreetMap has the site as a sports centre under its own name; the vertical is short, so this is lap-count riding.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No aerialway is mapped. Uplift is most likely the winter drag lift or a shuttle - treat it as unconfirmed. Around 270 SEK for a day.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>The directory gives a 4 June start; roughly June to the end of September.<br/>Daily opening hours: 16:00-21:00<br/><small>Season start from the directory listing; hours estimated - a local hill, so expect evenings and weekends.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Boras</td><td>Car</td><td>~25 min</td></tr><tr><td>Gothenburg</td><td>Car</td><td>~45 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://bollekollen.se/">Bollekollen</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
