  <Placemark>
    <name>Brattbakken Sykkelpark (Trondelag, Norway) [100 NOK]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Brattbakken 83 m - a small sykkelpark in Trondelag</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Only 2 marked runs, at least 1 blue. A very small local park north-east of Trondheim; OpenStreetMap has the place name but almost nothing else, so expect a short built hill rather than a network. Around 100 NOK a day makes it one of the cheapest in Norway.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No lift. Push or pedal. Around 100 NOK for a day.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Roughly mid-May to the end of September.<br/>Daily opening hours: daylight hours<br/><small>Estimated; not yet checked against the operator.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Steinkjer</td><td>Car</td><td>~40 min</td></tr><tr><td>Trondheim</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h30</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://brattbakken.com/">Brattbakken</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-brown</styleUrl>
    <Point><coordinates>10.280740,64.128460,83</coordinates></Point>
