  <Placemark>
    <name>Yxbacken Cykelpark (Norrkoping, Sweden) [200 SEK]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Norrkoping 12 m - the Yxbacken hill</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Five trails on Norrkoping Ski Club's hill at Hultsbruk, about 8 km out of town: one blue for beginners, three red and one black. Snoken is the smooth wide one, Rotmos the advanced line over rock and roots, and Djungelsvangen opens with technical features before it lets go.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The lift takes about a minute and a half to put you back on top. Day pass around 200 SEK adult and 150 SEK youth, though the club has run reduced days at 150 and 75 SEK when it is short of staff.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Roughly May to October, weather permitting.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Norrkoping centre</td><td>Car</td><td>~10 min</td></tr><tr><td>Stockholm</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h45</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.yxbacken.nu/cykelpark">Yxbacken Cykelpark</a> and <a href="https://affarsstaden.se/artiklar/yxbacken-inte-bara-skidakning/">Affarsstaden on Yxbacken</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
