  <Placemark>
    <name>Solnechnaya Dolina Bike Park (Miass, Russia) [700 RUB]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Solnechnaya Dolina 342 m - valley station of the Leitner four-seat chairlift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A South Ural resort at Syrostan, 10 km from Miass and close to Lake Turgoyak, where VeloParkPro began building a bike park in 2018: a planned 11.5 km of descent, individual trails of 1500 to 3000 m, weighted towards the easier end - roughly 48 percent easy, 39 percent intermediate and 13 percent hard.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The resort's chairlift carries bikes.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>The summer season.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Miass</td><td>Car</td><td>~25 min</td></tr><tr><td>Chelyabinsk</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h45</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.kp.ru/russia/chelyabinskaya-oblast/mesta/kurort-solnechnaya-dolina/">Solnechnaya Dolina resort</a> and <a href="https://www.uralweb.ru/urals/glc/chelyabinskaya_oblast/solnechnaya_dolina.html">UralWeb - Solnechnaya Dolina</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
