  <Placemark>
    <name>Chekeril Bike Park (Izhevsk, Russia) [1000 RUB]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Chekeril 123 m - valley station of the drag lift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A sports complex on the south-western edge of Izhevsk with eleven graded pistes, lifts and floodlighting in winter. <b>Be careful with expectations in summer:</b> the complex advertises volleyball courts, a beach, a rope park and horse riding for the warm months, and does not publish a mountain-bike trail list or a bike tariff, so confirm that lift-served riding is running before making the trip.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The ski lifts. Summer bike prices are not published; the winter tariff page and the phone number are the way to check.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Summer operation for biking is unconfirmed by the operator.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Izhevsk</td><td>Car</td><td>~25 min</td></tr><tr><td>Kazan</td><td>Car</td><td>~4h00</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://chekeril.ru/tarify">Chekeril tariffs</a> and <a href="https://www.ski.ru/az/resort/496/">Ski.ru - Chekeril</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
