  <Placemark>
    <name>Rayder Bike Park (Miass, Russia) [350 RUB]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Rayder 351 m - valley station of the drag lift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A small local downhill park in Miass, run on a volunteer footing - the sort of place a town's riders build for themselves.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The lift runs on Saturdays only, 12:00-17:00, and a day of lift-served riding is 350 RUB. <b>The trail is open for free riding without the lift every day.</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>The summer season, with lift Saturdays.<br/>Daily opening hours: 12:00-17:00 (Saturdays)<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Miass</td><td>Car</td><td>~20 min</td></tr><tr><td>Chelyabinsk</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h30</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="http://chelyabinsk.bezformata.com/listnews/miasse-bajk-park-rajder/22631286">Report on the Rayder bike park, Miass</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
