  <Placemark>
    <name>Slavex Trails (Zlin, Czech Republic) [free]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Zlin 422 m - the Slavex trail network</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A small trail park at Slavicin in the White Carpathians: four trails of over 3.5 km together, a mix of natural and lightly built ground, of which 1.8 km is proper bike-park style. The blue is fast and bermed and works for beginners and quick riders alike; the red adds jumps, log features, a large drop and a smaller one. Bejcek is the jump line, Hrabos a purely natural enduro trail, and there is a north-shore section on boardwalks. A dirt-jump area opened in June 2026. The climb back up is gentle enough not to wear you out.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/><b>No lift.</b> Free. Courses, camps and day camps run on the singletracks.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>The riding season, weather permitting.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Zlin centre</td><td>Bike</td><td>~20 min</td></tr><tr><td>Brno</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h15</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.slavextrails.cz/">Slavex Trails</a> and <a href="https://www.mesto-slavicin.cz/cs/prijizdim/kultura-a-sport/sport-zarizeni/slavex-trails.html">Mesto Slavicin</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-brown</styleUrl>
