  <Placemark>
    <name>Nore Bike Park (Itu, Brazil) [50 BRL]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Itu 689 m - Nore Bike Park</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A private park running since 2004 an hour from Sao Paulo, covering cross-country, freeride, all-mountain and dirt jump, with a pump track and BMX ground alongside. Seven trails for every level: Kids at 500 m and Light at 1.5 km for beginners, Sport (2 km) and Pro (2.5 km) in the middle, and For Fun (4 km), Jiboia (5 km) and the 1 km Nore Line at the hard end.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/><b>No lift.</b> Day use 50 BRL for 15 and over, 25 BRL for ages 5-14.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Saturdays, Sundays and public holidays 08:00-18:00. Weekdays by prior arrangement.<br/>Daily opening hours: 08:00-18:00<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Itu</td><td>Car</td><td>~15 min</td></tr><tr><td>Sao Paulo</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h15</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.facebook.com/norebiker/">Nore Bike Park</a> and <a href="http://guru.pedalpower.com.br/pedale/mountain-bike/nore-bike-park/">Guru Pedal Power</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
