  <Placemark>
    <name>Bikepark Leibstadt (Aargau, Switzerland) [free]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Aargau 318 m - Bikepark Leibstadt</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A single 360 m four-cross track with about 12 m of drop and four berms, built and maintained by VC Leibstadt. It splits into two lines: a pro section over 8 m doubles, and a normal section of smaller jump-and-roller combinations. A start gate makes it a racing track as much as a park.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No lift, and none needed on a track this length - ride back round.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Rideable spring to late autumn; open daily 09:00-20:00. Gravel surface, no lighting.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Zurich</td><td>Car</td><td>~45 min</td></tr><tr><td>Basel</td><td>Car</td><td>~50 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.vcleibstadt.ch/bikepark-leibstadt/">VC Leibstadt</a> and <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/1435862250">OSM way 1435862250</a> (ODbL). Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
