  <Placemark>
    <name>Bikepark Memmingen (Bavaria, Germany) [free]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Bavaria 627 m - Bikepark Memmingen</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A public practice park with lines graded across three levels - beginner, intermediate and a pro line - built and maintained by the Mountainbikeverein Memmingen, a volunteer club founded in 2019. Natural ground rather than hardpack, so it rides best when dry.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No lift. Push or pedal back up.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Roughly mid-March to mid-November, weather depending. No fixed hours; free to ride.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Memmingen</td><td>Car</td><td>~10 min</td></tr><tr><td>Munich</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h15</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://mountainbike-mm.de">Mountainbikeverein Memmingen</a> and <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/1447884664">OSM way 1447884664</a> (ODbL). Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
