  <Placemark>
    <name>Bikepark Pfäffikon ZH (Zurich, Switzerland) [free]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Zurich 605 m - Bikepark Pfäffikon ZH</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Four lines and 23 built features on a forest slope: a 210 m Flowtrail (easy), a 175 m Techline (intermediate), a 240 m Jumpline (easy to intermediate) and a dedicated uphill trail to lap them. Dirt surface. Entirely unstaffed - no ticket office, no personnel - so ride within your limits.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No lift, by design: the uphill trail is the way back to the top. Cars can reach the forest road or the reservoir, but not the trails.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>April to October, daily 08:00-20:00.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Zurich</td><td>Car</td><td>~30 min</td></tr><tr><td>Winterthur</td><td>Car</td><td>~20 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.bikeparkpfaeffikon.ch/park">Bikepark Pfaffikon</a> and <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/node/13944597399">OSM node 13944597399</a> (ODbL). Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
