  <Placemark>
    <name>Trailpark Zehra (Spis, Slovakia) [donation]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Spis 613 m - Trailpark Zehra</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Nine graded trails below Spis Castle, and one of the better-built networks in eastern Slovakia. Family Flow (green); Hradny Flow 1.7 km, Zipser Flow 1.1 km red, Paradise Line 165 m, Kelt Trail 505 m (blue); Koloman, Joker Trail 830 m, Majkyho Enduro and the jump-focused Crazy Zipser (black). An airbag is available for learning tricks.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>A shuttle runs to the top - about 20 EUR for five rides, and it must be booked because capacity is limited. Parking is 10 EUR per car.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Trails are open year-round; the Riders Bar runs Friday to Sunday 10:00-19:00. The trails themselves are free, on a voluntary donation of 2-20 EUR.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Poprad</td><td>Car</td><td>~40 min</td></tr><tr><td>Kosice</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h15</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.trailpark-zehra.sk">Trailpark Zehra</a> and <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/1086874058">OSM way 1086874058</a> (ODbL). Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-brown</styleUrl>
    <Point><coordinates>20.811080,48.980670,613</coordinates></Point>
