  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Shredhill Bike Park (Gloucestershire, England) [check operator]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Gloucestershire 54 m - Shredhill Bike Park</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Blue, red and black trails on the eastern edge of the Forest of Dean, plus mulch jumps, dirt jumps and a well-regarded 4X track. A built park rather than a hillside - the appeal is the jumps and the racing lines.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No lift. Push or pedal back up.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open year-round on set days: Saturday 10:00-18:00, Sunday 10:00-16:00, and Wednesdays from June 16:00 until late.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Gloucester</td><td>Car</td><td>~30 min</td></tr><tr><td>Bristol</td><td>Car</td><td>~50 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.shredhill.co.uk">Shredhill</a> and <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/node/12793389237">OSM node 12793389237</a> (ODbL). Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
