  <Placemark>
    <name>Bikepark Bad Saulgau (Baden-Wurttemberg, Germany) [free]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Baden-Wurttemberg 582 m - Bikepark Bad Saulgau</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A municipal park opened in October 2021 beside the town depot, in two halves: a pumptrack that can be ridden without pedalling, and a dirtpark of larger jump lines with smaller practice takeoffs for beginners.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No lift. Push or pedal back up.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Roughly mid-March to mid-November. Hours follow those of the town's other public facilities; no admission charge.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Ravensburg</td><td>Car</td><td>~45 min</td></tr><tr><td>Ulm</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h00</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://bikeparkslg.de/">Bikepark Bad Saulgau</a> and <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/node/9213381906">OSM node 9213381906</a> (ODbL). Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
