  <Placemark>
    <name>Bikepark Jumpzone Zilina - Solinky (Zilina, Slovakia) [free]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Zilina 368 m - Bikepark Jumpzone Zilina - Solinky</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A free dirt-jump area in the Solinky district, built and run by the city of Zilina. Openly accessible with no gate or ticket. Distinct from the Zilina Oko trail network on the hills above the city, which is a separate spot on this map.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No lift. Push back up.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Roughly mid-March to mid-November, weather depending. Dirt surface, so it suffers in the wet.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Zilina centre</td><td>Bike</td><td>~15 min</td></tr><tr><td>Bratislava</td><td>Car</td><td>~2h00</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/1492513166">OSM way 1492513166</a> (ODbL). Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
