  <Placemark>
    <name>ABC Bike Park (Hautes-Alpes, France) [check operator]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Hautes-Alpes 965 m - ABC Bike Park</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A small built area in the Hautes-Alpes recorded in OpenStreetMap as a bike park. No operator page could be found for it, so treat the scale as unknown: expect club-built lines rather than a lift-served resort, and ask locally before making a trip specifically for it.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/><b>No lift.</b> Pedal-up laps.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Snow-free months.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Briancon</td><td>Car</td><td>~25 min</td></tr><tr><td>Gap</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h15</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/">OpenStreetMap</a> (ODbL), which records the bike park at this location. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
