  <Placemark>
    <name>Bike-Park Bollenbach (Black Forest, Germany) [check operator]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Black Forest 206 m - Bike-Park Bollenbach</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A small community bike park in the Kinzig valley on the western edge of the Black Forest, recorded in OpenStreetMap as a bike park but without an operator page of its own. Expect built lines on a low hillside rather than an alpine descent, and check locally before making a trip for it.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/><b>No lift.</b> Pedal-up laps.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Rideable through the warmer months.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Offenburg</td><td>Car</td><td>~40 min</td></tr><tr><td>Freiburg</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h00</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.schwarzwald-tourismus.info/erleben/radfahren/mountainbike/bike-parks">Schwarzwald Tourismus bike parks</a> and <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/">OpenStreetMap</a> (ODbL), which records the park at this location. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
