  <Placemark>
    <name>Bikepark Rennacker - Insul (Eifel, Germany) [free]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Eifel 226 m - Bikepark Insul</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A village park behind the sports ground at Insul in the Ahr valley, right on the cycle path: a pump track with a flowline and a jumpline beside it. Small, free and useful rather than a destination - and a sign of the valley rebuilding after the 2021 Ahr floods. It reopened officially in April 2026.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/><b>No lift.</b> Free to use, at your own risk, and daylight only - the village asks riders to respect quiet hours.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Year round in daylight.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Bonn</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h00</td></tr><tr><td>Cologne</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h15</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.eifel.info/en/pois/bikepark-rennacker-insul">Eifel tourism - Bikepark Rennacker Insul</a> and <a href="https://bikepahrk.de/bikeparks/insul/">BikepAHRk</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
