  <Placemark>
    <name>Havok Bike Park - Calder Valley (England) [45 GBP uplift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Cockhill Wood 223 m - Havok Bike Park, near Todmorden</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Rider-owned and purpose-built across about 100 acres of hillside at Cockhill Wood near Todmorden, on the Yorkshire-Lancashire border. Six trails - a red, a black, a double black, a dual slalom, a dirt-jump zone and a pro freeride line - and it has hosted downhill racing. Run as a Community Interest Company, and eMTB friendly, which not every uplift park is.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>A paid uplift: 45 GBP a day for non-members, 35 GBP for members, and 5 GBP for single runs on quiet or wet days. Day entry without uplift is 12 GBP adult, 10 GBP under-18, 20 GBP e-bike. Annual membership 100 GBP adult, 80 GBP under-18, 160 GBP e-bike, which buys cheaper uplift. Cash or card on the day.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Weekends, 10:00-17:00, subject to change.<br/>Daily opening hours: 10:00-17:00<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Blackburn</td><td>Car</td><td>~20 min</td></tr><tr><td>Manchester</td><td>Car</td><td>~50 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.moredirt.com/trail/United-Kingdom_North-West/Havok-Bike-Park---Cockhill-Wood/1443">Havok Bike Park (MoreDirt)</a> and <a href="https://singletrackworld.com/2025/09/state-of-uk-downhill-racing-havok-bike-park-dh/">Singletrack World on Havok DH</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
