  <Placemark>
    <name>Proctor Bike Park (British Columbia, Canada) [free]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>British Columbia 14 m - Proctor Bike Park</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A municipal bike park on Trail Avenue in Sechelt, run by the District of Sechelt on the Sunshine Coast. Dirt surface, no lighting. The district's information sheet for the park is no longer online, so the feature list is unconfirmed.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No lift. Push or pedal back up.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Estimated for the coastal climate - roughly April to mid-November.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Sechelt</td><td>Car</td><td>~10 min</td></tr><tr><td>Vancouver</td><td>Ferry + car</td><td>~2h30</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/1531492414">OSM way 1531492414</a> (ODbL). Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-brown</styleUrl>
