    <name>Monarch Crest Trail: Monarch Pass to the Silver Creek turn</name>
    <description><![CDATA[23.2 km along the Continental Divide from the Monarch Pass trailhead 3459 m south over Marshall Pass 3319 m to the Silver Creek junction 3425 m, mostly above treeline. Geometry simplified from OpenStreetMap (ODbL) - indicative only. Sources: <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/431183252">way 431183252</a>, <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/186667251">way 186667251</a>, <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/649616568">way 649616568</a>, <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/215256968">way 215256968</a>, <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/810344709">way 810344709</a>, <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/334611133">way 334611133</a>.]]></description>
