  <Placemark>
    <name>Monarch Crest: Silver Creek Trail</name>
    <description><![CDATA[7.3 km of fast rocky descending from the Colorado Trail at 3425 m down to the Rainbow Trail junction at 2886 m. Geometry simplified from OpenStreetMap (ODbL) - indicative only. Sources: <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/105225431">way 105225431</a>, <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/17142424">way 17142424</a>.]]></description>
