  <Placemark>
    <name>Monarch Crest Trail: Marshall Pass</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Marshall Pass 3319 m - halfway point on the crest</b><br/><br/>
    Where the Monarch Crest Trail meets the old railroad grade and the Colorado Trail carries on south towards the Silver Creek turn. The bail-out: Marshall Pass Road drops east to Poncha Springs from here.]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-gray</styleUrl>
    <Point><coordinates>-106.247068,38.391290,3319</coordinates></Point>
