  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Monarch Crest Trail: Rainbow Trail exit</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Rainbow Trail western trailhead 2589 m - end of the singletrack</b><br/><br/>
    Where the Rainbow Trail ends and dirt road runs out to Highway 285 and Poncha Springs. See the main Monarch Crest Trail pin for the route, shuttles and season.]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-gray</styleUrl>
    <Point><coordinates>-106.105040,38.445060,2589</coordinates></Point>
